Now I don't know-... Of course, pretty much every inhabitant of Throne has -something- on their forehead.<br /> <br /> And to Doran: I really hope you're right about 82. It would be sad for us to have said goodbye to out angelic friend forever, at least so soon in the story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T09:18:24-07:00","id":191455,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>doran</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=190651#post190651\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-3-53-54\" target=\"_blank\">Latest Comic</a><br /> I'm also wondering if 82 is really dead or merely lacking a current shell.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm hoping 82 is still alive. IIRC, there was that one picture we saw where they had the <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=chapter-3\" target=\"_blank\">flame full of eyes flaring from their body</a>, and I'm gonna be disappointed if we never see that, you know, for real.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":561,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","user":"Mockery","date":". 07-09-2014, 02:28 AM"},"attac