20-000-worlds-a-legendary#notes\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/1147fc8c4f998c9ebbdba6581b7d3f5a/tumblr_mv4ee61dGs1qlxan5o1_1280.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://orbitaldropkick.tumblr.com/post/64858920285/the-conqueror-of-20-000-worlds-a-legendary#notes\" target=\"_blank\"> BY THE POWER OF RA </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://orbitaldropkick.tumblr.com/post/64858920285/the-conqueror-of-20-000-worlds-a-legendary#notes\" target=\"_blank\"> http://orbitaldropkick.tumblr.com/post/64858920285/the-conqueror-of-20-000-worlds-a-legendary#notes </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> The conqueror of 20,000 worlds. A legendary general, now an overweight drunk, and foulmouthed recluse. Upcoming character for Kill Six Billion Demons. </div> </div> </div><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T01:51:19-07:00","id":192194,"title":"","content":"Good Lord, an overweight woman as an insanely powerful swordswoman! If this comic hadn't had my attention from the outset, it would firmly have it now. This even kind of puts it a slight step over Exalted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T08:06:15-07:00","id":192414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=192194#post192194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Good Lord, an overweight woman as an insanely powerful swordswoman! If this comic hadn't had my attention from the outset, it would firmly have it now. This even kind of puts it a slight step over Exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>And her name is Maya Mantra, which means I can't use that name for my J-Pop/R&amp;B/Heavy Metal fusion band anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;We do not quit playing because we grow old, we grow old because we quit playing.&quot; - Oliver Wendell Holmes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/283-mrinsecure","name":"MrInsecure","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar283_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"385"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T21:02:20-07:00","id":204635,"title":"","content":"New comic up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1685-looker","name":"Looker","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T10:41:38-07:00","id":206303,"title":"","content":"Come to think of it, regarding 82, isn't part of the deal with angels that their current bodies are artificial, made for them by the demiurges? It might just be that the body is broken, and can either be repaired or replaced.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T14:03:29-07:00","id":206514,"title":"","content":"That is certainly what I'm expecting.<br /> <br /> Now, to design a fourth god...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T18:16:03-07:00","id":206716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=206303#post206303\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Come to think of it, regarding 82, isn't part of the deal with angels that their current bodies are artificial, made for them by the demiurges? It might just be that the body is broken, and can either be repaired or replaced.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah I would have thought so. Hmm, maybe Devils are similar with their masks, being the Ys counterpart to Un's angels.<br /> <br /> On a completely unrelated note; out of curiosity, what Gods have you guys in this thread submitted?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T22:02:25-07:00","id":206769,"title":"","content":"My submission, posted on the thread on the site itself (where I post as Oph, Vizier of the New Sea). If I were more clever and remembered how to do it, I'd hide it in a cut; as it is I can only pray it's not long enough to be quite a wall of text. A fence, perhaps, or a small cairn.<br /> <br /> UN-OTASH<br /> Called the Shattered, or He Who Scatters Oblations, or OTASH In Whose Arms None Rest.<br /> UN-OTASH surrounded himself with stone images of his body, broken or bound, so that he would not sleep easily, and the images made of him have always a unique disfigurement that his image within the minds of the many will not have safe resting. His mudra, when his hands are not broken or tied, is a symbol of the restive scholar and the unquiet dead.<br /> In form, he was simple, humanoid and slender, with long fingers and feet, and towering shoulders, skull, and hips, like obelisks. He was known to walk the Red City deep in thought, scattering hosts before him with the touch of his sight. His one luxury was a crown of intricate design, with half a hundred eyes, all of which gazed on horrors. He is said to have kept a garden, hidden within the city, and that it was a place of perfect beauty tended by the prime angels which he never visited.<br /> Acceptable offerings include nightmares, papers written in the depths of night and never published, and long voyages through harsh climes. Offerings of food and drink may be made, and silks and finery, but the priests of UN-OTASH will chase any such supplicant from altars, and throw aside the offerings into the filth. Such is holy, and beloved of UN-OTASH.<br /> Of course, the gods are dead; UN-OTASH is no exception. His priests still chant and act. Such is the proof of godhood.<br /> <br /> YS-SCANTHAYE<br /> Called the Glorious, the Half-Beautiful, Scan Ia Ia Scan Ia Ia Scan, the Daughter of Loss.<br /> The nature of YS-SCANTHAYE is to be indescribable in full, but beloved in part. Her shoulder, human. Her wings, eels. Her legs, chitinous. Her face would require of a poet a thousand thousand ages, and thus she wore masks each day, lest her peers be frozen in contemplation, and few clothes else, lest they lose their memory of her monstrosity and fail in their adoration. She enjoyed games of strategy, and music with a strong beat and loud screaming. Her devotional hymns require the dancing of dervishes, spinning and banging their heads. Her image in stone, in miniature, is impossible \u2013 instead a shapeless rock is engraved with spirals and in jagged lines, and an ivory mask sealed to it as a face.<br /> Her most famous accomplishments were in war and in politics, in which her obvious strength masked her cunning and her true danger.<br /> Supplicants approach her image who desire their strength to hide their truer qualities, though the uninitiated will approach in hopes of gaining such strength and beauty as is obvious to her. Suitable oblations include fruit, game pieces stolen from someone else\u2019s complete set, or carefully wrought images of a single part of her, such that they may be comprehended, though the whole may not be held in the mind\u2019s eye. Her priests spend years in thought, attempting to know two of her parts at one time, and rarely do any good for anyone. Of course, the gods are dead, and YS-SCANTHAYE is no exception. Nonetheless, her prayers are sung and her masks carved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3547-sonofsilkandstone","name":"SonOfSilkAndStone","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T20:23:32-07:00","id":220671,"title":"","content":"Man, that <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=kill-six-billion-demons-chapter-4\" target=\"_blank\">latest update</a>, even uncolored, is just...I don't even...gah, please Onyx Path, hire Abbadon to do at least a few illustrations of Malfeas in an appropriate book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltificatio