allen. Divine ultraviolence shall rise.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-4-58-2\" target=\"_blank\">Feast! Maggots of the Divine Corpse!</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Awww Yisssss!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">It's totally Where's Wally, doe'.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T11:07:27-07:00","id":243290,"title":"","content":"That bit about angels as an alternate universe version of battle tanks is going in my First Age now.<br /> <br /> Not quite as Warstriders, more as one of the higher tiers of combat golem.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/nw5QIYM.png\" target=\"_blank\">Because in the First Age, armoured divisions consisted of battle golems who knew mighty martial arts, plated troops who'd be ferried around on their shoulders, enormous metal giants who'd provide long range support and defence from aerial attack with lances forged from sunbeams, and the Exalted commanders in Warstriders.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.th