and guildsmen. Hehe. Bartering is basically what they do best.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T00:52:52-08:00","id":317094,"title":"","content":"Maybe we need this &quot;Black Glass&quot; as a new magical Material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T01:47:53-08:00","id":317119,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nervaqus987</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=316952#post316952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And can I just say that I love the bartering that immediately goes on?</div> </div> </div> </div>Bidding, not bartering.<br /> <br /> And yes, I do love how they immediately undercut the grandeur of the big bad demon coming in and telling them to cut that shit out through the power of capitalism.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T05:04:02-08:00","id":317290,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=317094#post317094\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe we need this &quot;Black Glass&quot; as a new magical Material.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually have to wonder what &quot;Black Glass&quot; is and what it's used for. 82 mentioned that Omun Vash apparently smuggles the stuff, so it seems either illegal or strictly regulated.<br /> It's right up there next to 'Glyphosphere' on my curiosity list.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T07:36:41-08:00","id":317361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kleptomania</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=317290#post317290\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I actually have to wonder what &quot;Black Glass&quot; is and what it's used for. 82 mentioned that Omun Vash apparently smuggles the stuff, so it seems either illegal or strictly regulated.<br /> It's right up there next to 'Glyphosphere' on my curiosity list.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I imagine it's some kind of great commodity, like a drug.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/393-godjaw","name":"Godjaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar393_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"665"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T02:48:00-08:00","id":318121,"title":"","content":"I keep thinking of it as a recoloured form of mephamphetamine.<br /> <br /> Possibly by the addition of some kind of demon bile or something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T05:46:05-08:00","id":318179,"title":"","content":"I caught up on this comic recently again. I have a hard time keeping up to date with comics that update less than twice a week, so I tend to read them in bursts instead. It's actually quite a pleasant way to read, if you can bear the long waits, of course.<br /> <br /> Black glass immediately registered as some sort of drug in my head, too.<br /> <br /> Regarding the last panel on <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-4-67\" target=\"_blank\">this page</a>, might it be possible that the idea of partners doesn't really exist in Throne? I realize we've been seeing only the perspective of 82, and been to one specific hell, but there is a whole hell of a lot of slavery going around. The first thing anyone in hell 71 asked 82 was if Allison was for sale. Could it be that you normally just buy a slave that can fulfill the need you have at the moment? That would explain the reaction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T08:33:48-08:00","id":318269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=318179#post318179\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Regarding the last panel on <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-4-67\" target=\"_blank\">this page</a>, might it be possible that the idea of partners doesn't really exist in Throne? I realize we've been seeing only the perspective of 82, and been to one specific hell, but there is a whole hell of a lot of slavery going around. The first thing anyone in hell 71 asked 82 was if Allison was for sale. Could it be that you normally just buy a slave that can fulfill the need you have at the moment? That would explain the reaction.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's possible, but one must remember that the one Hell we have seen is a brothel run by a 'mammal aficionado'. Throne has a lot of cultural diversity and variety, so it would be strange for the concept of romantic relationships to be completely nonexistent.<br /> Come to think of it, maybe it's a Devil thing, specifically? One of their three qualities is an Iron Heart after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T11:51:12-08:00","id":323007,"title":"","content":"New Page up.<br /> <br /> Noodle Lady is pretty high up on the list of people not to be fucked with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T13:53:49-08:00","id":323147,"title":"","content":"Note that she didn't say &quot;I got hungry&quot;, but &quot;I got greedy&quot;. That's not normally something you'd consider a justification. It's an interesting turn of phrase. I read somewhere that YISUN's philosophy premiers desire, ignorance and violence, so it might have something to do with that.<br /> <br /> I'm not really sure if the last panel implies that she cut down anyone within a 10 foot radius before they could raise their blades, or if it just means that no one was dumb enough to get that close to her. That last would kind of mean people knew who she was, though, and I'm not sure they do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T15:25:25-08:00","id":323200,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=323147#post323147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not really sure if the last panel implies that she cut down anyone within a 10 foot radius before they could raise their blades, or if it just means that no one was dumb enough to get that close to her. That last would kind of mean people knew who she was, though, and I'm not sure they do.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Look at the curves of the slashes in......everything, really. They are all curved <i>away</i> from &quot;Auntie Maya.&quot;<br /> <br /> Apparently, anyone that got close enough to the point where they may disturb her meal got sliced up something nasty.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T01:30:13-08:00","id":323519,"title":"","content":"&quot;Beware the swordsman who carries no blade.&quot;<br /> <br /> New perspective on Glorious Solar Saber.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T08:27:24-08:00","id":323641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=323147#post323147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Note that she didn't say &quot;I got hungry&quot;, but &quot;I got greedy&quot;. That's not normally something you'd consider a justification. It's an interesting turn of phrase.</div> </div> </div> </div>Her expression seems to imply that she's not so much justifying as apologising.<br /> <br /> {Rechecks comic} That and the fact that she uses the words &quot;I'm sorry&quot;.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Owning up to some degree of fault is actually fairly common in English-speaking apologies, especially ones that might be considered less than sincere.<br /> <br /> You know, the kind of thing that says &quot;oh, yeah <i>I</i> know I'm awful, so you're not allowed to get mad about it&quot;, the kind of thing that disarms another by presenting oneself as penitent.<br /> <br /> I'd also say that her specific wording carries a certain tone of playful scolding; &quot;you were very greedy&quot; is the kind of thing you would expect to say to a child, so using it to infantilise yourself is another way to kind of rob momentum from another. Considering she then refers to herself as &quot;Auntie Maya&quot;, it would seem to imply a lot about her character, putting on a kind of matronly air.<br /> <br /> I actually rather like this strip; it's managed to convey a lot of personality in highly economic terms, in a manner that serves to complement an already interesting character design and background in an unexpected manner, and has also straightforwardly and credibly established her as a badass amidst a world that already looks like it is brimming with violence.<br /> <br /> I mean, think about it; she maintained an eye of calm, without missing a beat, amidst a scene of such extreme violence that it gave <i>angels</i> pause.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T05:42:35-08:00","id":329142,"title":"","content":"Aaaaannnnd Title Drop!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T06:00:29-08:00","id":329149,"title":"","content":"Oh my, oh my, oh my. Such update.<br /> <br /> I can't believe I didn't recognise the crown before.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T06:52:13-08:00","id":329169,"title":"","content":"Hm. I wonder why he's calling her &quot;Alice&quot; instead of &quot;Allison&quot; (aside from the obvious Alice in Wonderland reference).<br /> <br /> Maybe he knows something she doesn't?<br /> <br /> Edit: Wait. Her soul. It looks a lot like... no, no, couldn't be.<br /> <br /> ... could it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T07:15:20-08:00","id":329183,"title":"","content":"Yay! Non-Linear Time!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T07:30:40-08:00","id":329188,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=329169#post329169\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hm. I wonder why he's calling her &quot;Alice&quot; instead of &quot;Allison&quot; (aside from the obvious Alice in Wonderland reference).<br /> <br /> Maybe he knows something she doesn't?<br /> <br /> Edit: Wait. Her soul. It looks a lot like... no, no, couldn't be.<br /> <br /> ... could it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Allison -&gt; Alice -&gt; Aesma?<br /> <br /> I doubt it. I think that that's just how purely spiritual beings are drawn, at least female ones (it's the original form of YIS, <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-2-31\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T13:12:24-08:00","id":329513,"title":"","content":"If anything is clear to me its that this guy would be a better choice to illustrate the next infernal or direction: malfeas book then most any artist I can imagine. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Could probably do a mean glipses of the first age too <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3085-chance","name":"chance","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T13:49:38-08:00","id":329526,"title":"","content":"Okay, let me see if I've got my timeline of events right.<br /> <br /> 1) At the beginning, Yisun was the omnipotent master of everything and was the only thing that existed.<br /> <br /> 2) Yisun decided this state of affairs sucked and committed suicide.<br /> <br /> 3) Yis and Un were created.<br /> <br /> 4) Yis and Un go to war.<br /> <br /> 5) Yis and Un have sex.<br /> <br /> 6) This creates all of the various gods in the setting.<br /> <br /> 7) Shenanigans happen and eventually the Gods die/suicide/whatever and leave Throne empty.<br /> <br /> 8) Things go to shit for a while.<br /> <br /> 9) The Conquering King is able to force his way into Throne, throws down with the Primes and mops the floor with them.<br /> <br /> 10) Others make their way to Throne and join with the Conquering King, becoming known as the Demiurges.<br /> <br /> 11) They all get their First Age up and create/employ the Angels, Mask the Devils, found the four orders of Knights, etc.<br /> <br /> 12) Shit is good.<br /> <br /> 13) The Demiurges start wanting more and more.<br /> <br /> 14) The Demiurges go to war and forge the Keys and Gates.<br /> <br /> 15) Shit is bad.<br /> <br /> 16) When the dust settles, there's seven Demiurges left who make their Pact and each walk away with 111,111 universes.<br /> <br /> 17) Shit is still bad/gets worse?<br /> <br /> 18) Time passes.<br /> <br /> 19) The Conquering King steals/creates a Key and heads to Earth.<br /> <br /> 20) The Conquering King finds Allison, gets decapitated, shoves the Key into her head and punts her to Throne. In that order.<br /> <br /> 21) The rest of the comic happens.<br /> <br /> <br /> So.....I get everything?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar