","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T15:31:45-08:00","id":329602,"title":"","content":"This scripture is the best one yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T15:46:41-08:00","id":329607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=329188#post329188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Allison -&gt; Alice -&gt; Aesma?<br /> <br /> I doubt it. I think that that's just how purely spiritual beings are drawn, at least female ones (it's the original form of YIS, <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-2-31\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Someone in the comments pointed it out<br /> Alison / Alice-UN<br /> <br /> Perhaps the suffix denotes the gender of gods/ demiurges?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T17:32:36-08:00","id":329675,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nervaqus987</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=329526#post329526\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, let me see if I've got my timeline of events right.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> At the beginning, Yisun was the omnipotent master of everything and was the only thing that existed.<br /> <br /> 2) Yisun decided this state of affairs sucked and committed suicide.<br /> <br /> 3) Yis and Un were created.<br /> <br /> 4) Yis and Un go to war.<br /> <br /> 5) Yis and Un have sex.<br /> <br /> 6) This creates all of the various gods in the setting.<br /> <br /> 7) Shenanigans happen and eventually the Gods die/suicide/whatever and leave Throne empty.<br /> <br /> 8) Things go to shit for a while.<br /> <br /> 9) The Conquering King is able to force his way into Throne, throws down with the Primes and mops the floor with them.<br /> <br /> 10) Others make their way to Throne and join with the Conquering King, becoming known as the Demiurges.<br /> <br /> 11) They all get their First Age up and create/employ the Angels, Mask the Devils, found the four orders of Knights, etc.<br /> <br /> 12) Shit is good.<br /> <br /> 13) The Demiurges start wanting more and more.<br /> <br /> 14) The Demiurges go to war and forge the Keys and Gates.<br /> <br /> 15) Shit is bad.<br /> <br /> 16) When the dust settles, there's seven Demiurges left who make their Pact and each walk away with 111,111 universes.<br /> <br /> 17) Shit is still bad/gets worse?<br /> <br /> 18) Time passes.<br /> <br /> 19) The Conquering King steals/creates a Key and heads to Earth.<br /> <br /> 20) The Conquering King finds Allison, gets decapitated, shoves the Key into her head and punts her to Throne. In that order.<br /> <br /> 21) The rest of the comic happens. </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> So.....I get everything?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's my current theory that the parts listed as 19 and 20 follow 15, but I may be wrong. As was said: Yay, non-linear time!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T18:15:02-08:00","id":329711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nervaqus987</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=329526#post329526\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So.....I get everything?</div> </div> </div> </div>Roughly. We don't know if there's more to Alison than meets the eye (some of the way he talks to her seems to imply it). And he seems to be asking her to kill the seven remaining Demiurges, going by the &quot;seven heads&quot; thing.<br /> <br /> We also don't know what happened to the Conquering King between the end of the war and today -- I doubt he was one of the surviving Demiurges, which means he was probably presumed dead. In retrospect it might have been a mistake to assume that the guy who mopped the floor with the last servants of God would go down that easily.<br /> <br /> He says &quot;Slay it, Kingling! You are my redeemer!&quot; My interpretation is that he regrets what he did when he was the ruler of the universe (leading to the rise of the Demiurges), and wants Allison to end their rule as a form of penance rather than for revenge.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>doran</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=329607#post329607\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Someone in the comments pointed it out<br /> Alison / Alice-UN<br /> <br /> Perhaps the suffix denotes the gender of gods/ demiurges?</div> </div> </div> </div>Except that <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-2-31\" target=\"_blank\">UN is the male half of god, isn't he?</a><br /> <br /> Granted, the Conquering King might simply have been confused by Allison's name and thought that she was Alice-un, with a suffix that just didn't match her gender.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Although come to think of it, he may be getting her name wrong, but how does he know it at all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":517,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","user":"Aquillion","date":". 12-03-2014, 10:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T20:25:43-08:00","id":329839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=329711#post329711\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We also don't know what happened to the Conquering King between the end of the war and today -- I doubt he was one of the surviving Demiurges, which means he was probably presumed dead. In retrospect it might have been a mistake to assume that the guy who mopped the floor with the last servants of God would go down that easily.<br /> <br /> He says &quot;Slay it, Kingling! You are my redeemer!&quot; My interpretation is that he regrets what he did when he was the ruler of the universe (leading to the rise of the Demiurges), and wants Allison to end their rule as a form of penance rather than for revenge.</div> </div> </div> </div>Same.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Granted, the Conquering King might simply have been confused by Allison's name and thought that she was Alice-un, with a suffix that just didn't match her gender.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Although come to think of it, he may be getting her name wrong, but how does he know it at all? </div> </div> </div>I tend not to be overly surprised when someone like the Conquering King knows something.<br /> <br /> <br /> More interestingly, I was looking over the most recent page and the one where 82 first started telling the story about the Conquering King.<br /> <br /> The King had a red gem, what was most likely his personal Key or equivalent, on his forehead. In the recent page, he has a hole where the gem was.<br /> <br /> I think that the Conquering King gave Allison his <i>own</i> Key.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T20:51:16-08:00","id":329851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>doran</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=329607#post329607\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Someone in the comments pointed it out<br /> Alison / Alice-UN<br /> <br /> Perhaps the suffix denotes the gender of gods/ demiurges?</div> </div> </div> </div>Also Alison : al-YS-UN<br /> <br /> I don't know if it means anything yet, but it's food for thought","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user"