"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-04T03:16:11-08:00","id":329974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=329851#post329851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also Alison : al-YS-UN<br /> <br /> I don't know if it means anything yet, but it's food for thought</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh snap! If that means that she's some kind of reincarnation of the YS-UN... holy crap","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-10T15:08:37-08:00","id":336366,"title":"","content":"New page up and unless I miss my guess, we've gotten our first look at one of the Seven.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-10T16:09:53-08:00","id":336408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nervaqus987</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=336366#post336366\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">New page up and unless I miss my guess, we've gotten our first look at one of the Seven.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> And we know what happened to the boyfriend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/393-godjaw","name":"Godjaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar393_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"665"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-10T19:10:14-08:00","id":336576,"title":"","content":"Something I only just noticed on a reread. The panel in the upper-left of 82's story about the Conquering King, <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-3-42\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, which shows the moment the Conquering King breached the firmament and arrived in Throne via Division.<br /> <br /> Do you recognize the other person in that panel? It looks like 82 was able to tell that story in such detail because they had a front-row seat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-10T19:17:43-08:00","id":336580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=336576#post336576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Something I only just noticed on a reread. The panel in the upper-left of 82's story about the Conquering King, <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-3-42\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, which shows the moment the Conquering King breached the firmament and arrived in Throne via Division.<br /> <br /> Do you recognize the other person in that panel? It looks like 82 was able to tell that story in such detail because they had a front-row seat.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, that's just a picture of 82 telling the story. Note that his eye is cracked open in this panel, because he lied about giving up Allison. The story takes place before the creation of the Angels, I believe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-14T18:59:34-08:00","id":340351,"title":"","content":"Has anyone else noticed that a lot of the theology is taken from the 36 Lessons of Vivec from the Elder Scrolls?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-14T19:04:49-08:00","id":340355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=340351#post340351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone else noticed that a lot of the theology is taken from the 36 Lessons of Vivec from the Elder Scrolls?</div> </div> </div> </div>Its inspired absolutely, but in turn both were inspired by hindu and buddhist scripture.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/393-godjaw","name":"Godjaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar393_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"665"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-14T19:37:24-08:00","id":340368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Godjaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=340355#post340355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Its inspired absolutely, but in turn both were inspired by hindu and buddhist scripture.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>No that you mention it, I see some of the influence. I picked up on it more from the direct quotes, &quot;Reach heaven by violence&quot;, &quot;The secret Tower within the Tower is the shape of the only name of God, I.&quot; and &quot;secret syllable of royalty&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T12:44:37-08:00","id":345046,"title":"","content":"Update!<br /> <br /> And it looks like the Seven get along about as well as can be expected.<br /> <br /> Also, they apparently know that for the Conquering King, mere death is not enough to stay his hand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T13:04:11-08:00","id":345059,"title":"","content":"So...is the boyfriend an Incubus? Or am I reading too much into this? (I really don't like the boyfriend character personally.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T13:27:28-08:00","id":345073,"title":"","content":"We don't know much <i>about</i> the boyfriend character yet. We've only seen him for about five pages, and only heard him talk in three. It's too early to call.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T14:20:05-08:00","id":345150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">So...is the boyfriend an Incubus?</div> </div> </div> </div> Incubus is the name of one of the Seven.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T14:22:41-08:00","id":345151,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=345073#post345073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We don't know much <i>about</i> the boyfriend character yet. We've only seen him for about five pages, and only heard him talk in three. It's too early to call.</div> </div> </div> </div>I...personally assumed he was dead, after the start of the comic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T14:27:45-08:00","id":345155,"title":"","content":"Eh, I'd figured he was going to pop up again eventually; this is not a series that shies away from letting you know that a character is now bereft of life. That said, my initial impressions of the guy do not make me emotionally invested in his continued well-being.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T16:22:49-08:00","id":345217,"title":"","content":"So, let's see if we can tally them up... Solomon is obvious, and still looks like he did when they made their pact. I take it the one who is having her (?) face painted was that one who had the long black hair and the long sword, I'm going to assume that one is Jadis. The one called Great Red Idiot and Grand Dragon I imagine is the huge person with the tusks, who I'll take as Jagganoth. I can't tell which of the bottom two in that original picture would have been Mottom, the one with the robes or the one with the feminine figure and revealing clothing. I suppose the absentee Incubus is the guy with the kind of pointy head and face mask. I'm arbitrarily guessing the four-eyed monster is Gog-Agog, which would leave whichever one isn't Mottom to be Mammon. That has me think that that shadowy figure in the monolith behind those Klan-looking folks is Mammon, meaning Gog-Agog is also absent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T16:52:34-08:00","id":345232,"title":"","content":"Oh wait, no... I notice the table has an absent space, which also has a lot of cracking at it, so I assume <i>that</i> is where Jagganoth sits; Mottom is saying that she expected him to not show up, but she's also offended by how Incubus and Gog-Agog(?) have also sent proxies, with the latter being the Grand Dragon as distinct from the Great Red Idiot. Although... the First Consort seems to be seated in front of a rather large chair, so what if <i>Incubus</i> is actually the big leonine one who had the sickle in its mouth?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T17:18:13-08:00","id":345270,"title":"","content":"Going over this and making my own comments.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=345217#post345217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, let's see if we can tally them up... Solomon is obvious, and still looks like he did when they made their pact.</div> </div> </div> </div>Looks like, aside from the fact that he's evidently grown a beard in the meantime(kinda hard to notice since it's the exact same shade as his skin).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I take it the one who is having her (?) face painted was that one who had the long black hair and the long sword, I'm going to assume that one is Jadis. </div> </div> </div>Actually, looking back at the first image of the Seven we'd seen(<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-3-45\" target=\"_blank\">this</a>), on the far right next to Solomon, there's a Lord in a green cloak with no face. I think that may be the crazy one.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The one called Great Red Idiot and Grand Dragon I imagine is the huge person with the tusks, who I'll take as Jagganoth. </div> </div> </div>Going from the way Mottom was speaking, the &quot;Great Red Idiot&quot; is different from the Grand Dragon.<br /> <br /> She goes, &quot;Seven new gods, seven Lords of Infinity. At least you would think Seven would have the gall to show up! The Great Red Idiot I expected, but I get a paper pusher(who starts to mention the Grand Dragon, but Mottom talks over him) and a prostitute!&quot;<br /> <br /> From my reading of things, she expected Great Red to be a no show, but she also got two more than she expected.<br /> <br /> The Great Red Idiot, I think is the one on the immediate left of the center figure in the link above. Especially seeing as, when the Seven are shown again(three pages latter, <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-3-48\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>) he'd noticeably bigger than the others.<br /> <br /> The Grand Dragon, I feel, is the figure on the far left hand side of the original picture. The one that is distinctly inhuman in comparison to the other Lords.<br /> <br /> Incubus is, obviously I feel, the white haired pretty boy in the center.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I can't tell which of the bottom two in that original picture would have been Mottom, the one with the robes or the one with the feminine figure and revealing clothing. </div> </div> </div>Mottom, I've got pegged as the blonde in the skimpy get up. No particular reason why, though. Mostly because of the radical difference between then and now.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I suppose the absentee Incubus is the guy with the kind of pointy head and face mask. I'm arbitrarily guessing the four-eyed monster is Gog-Agog, which would leave whichever one isn't Mottom to be Mammon. <b>That has me think that that shadowy figure in the monolith behind those Klan-looking folks</b> is Mammon, meaning Gog-Agog is also absent. </div> </div> </div>Huh, missed that guy in my first read through of the comic.<br /> <br /> Hmm.....okay, comparing and contrasting, the guy in the monolith seems very much like the guy on the far right in the original like, both having the same shadowy hood covering their face completely save for a single burning eye/dot in the center of their face.<br /> <br /> And now looking back up, I think you're right and that the woman with the long hair and sword is the crazy one getting her makeup done. She seemed to have had a vaguely oriental appearance and her tiny servants seem to have the same rough look.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-20T04:57:34-08:00","id":345680,"title":"","content":"The Seven may or may not be color coded. (I'm fairly certain about the names and possibly the identities.)<br /> <br /> Let's start with Mottom. She's the one currently speaking, and seems to have not aged very well. She shares Orange with the &quot;Grand Dragon&quot; (Who's probably Mammon) <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/LzqDroF.png\" target=\"_blank\">Then</a>, <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/SZRV4o3.png?1\" target=\"_blank\">Now.</a><br /> <br /> Next there's Gog-Agog. The Green cloaked person. <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/PBsuW9j.png\" target=\"_blank\">Then</a>, <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/8Nlc5pP.png\" target=\"_blank\">Now</a>. However, Gog-Agog and Jadis may be mixed in this case- while on one hand the color coding is correct, It seems pretty possible for Jadis to be Crazy Face and for Gog-Agog to be Shadow-Pillar-Person. That would fit their general.. theme? better, but would break the idea of color coding. So: Jadis, in Blue. <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/vfhPxwf.png\" target=\"_blank\">Then</a>, <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/pB8Jf3o.png\" target=\"_blank\">Now</a>.<br /> <br /> Solomon is obvious and Purple.<br /> <br /> And then onto the no-shows.<br /> <br /> The Big Red Idiot (Who is either Mammon or Jagganoth, I personally favor Jagganoth) <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/7E0KjoU.png\" target=\"_blank\">Then</a>.<br /> <br /> Next is the &quot;Grand Dragon&quot; (Once again, either Mammon or Jagganoth) He(?) sent a representative (The paper pusher mentioned). Color is another shade of Orange, or Yellow perhaps. <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/lxTsrXi.png\" target=\"_blank\">Then</a>.<br /> <br /> Finally, Incubus who has the color of Pinkish. He sent his First Consort. <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/fVk2i3C.png?1\" target=\"_blank\">Then</a>.<br /> <br /> <br /> Or at least, this seems like the most likely way for things to go. Probably.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4578,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","user":"Zale","date":". 12-20-2014, 08:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-20T06:49:58-08:00","id":345734,"title":"","content":"Gog-Agog is most certainly not Crazy-Face; I'm pretty certain that's Jadis. Shadow-Pillar-Person is almost certainly Gog-Agog, because of the association with decay that Gog would have due to his status as Father of Worms (a title given to him in the author's Tumblr).<br /> <br /> I assume Jadis is named after the White Witch. Which pleases me greatly.<br /> <br /> Oh, and the tusked guy is definitely Jagganoth. Who I'd imagine is the Big Red Idiot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-21T11:51:52-08:00","id":346865,"title":"","content":"So.<br /> <br /> I feel sorta silly for not finding this earlier, but apparently the author had the Demiurges listed off on his tumbler with their names.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orbitaldropkick.tumblr.com/post/82790283313/mammon-jadis-jagganoth-incubus-mottom-solomon#notes\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a>.<br /> <br /> Also, I found <a href=\"http://orbitaldropkick.tumblr.com/image/105530278761\" target=\"_blank\">this </a>while going through the comments section of the recent page.<br /> <br /> Also, I'd really recommend going through and reading the comments section for the pages. All sorts of interesting tidbits seem to fall out there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-21T12:39:57-08:00","id":346889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nervaqus987</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel sorta silly for not finding this earlier, but apparently the author had the Demiurges listed off on his tumbler with their names.</div> </div> </div> </div> Also the alt-text to the comic that first stated their pact (where 82 was needled through the head). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Although this blog post does seem to map names directly to faces, so that's good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-21T12:53:53-08:00","id":346894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=346889#post346889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Also the alt-text to the comic that first stated their pact (where 82 was needled through the head). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Although this blog post does seem to map names directly to faces, so that's good.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yep, although comparing that one to this one, the names are also in a different order as well as not being mapped directly to the faces.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-03T23:22:04-08:00","id":358837,"title":"","content":"So, it's something from the forum game that eventually spawned the webcomic Kill Six Billion Demons, but it is Exalted's cosmology personified:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;God is Dead</i>, you say, simply, savoring the dark fire of the meta-Brandy and the beautiful bloody slash of the infinite ahead of you. Already her destination is materializing around you, inch by inch.<br /> <br /> <i>I was wrong to stop there</i>, you continue, <i> first, because this is common knowledge now. God died at the moment of His creation. I have slept in his corpse.</i><br /> <br /> You take another draft.<br /> <br /> <i>But the real question, </i> you say, and this is the real ringer, <i> is what happens to God's house after he dies? Do the mice and the rats and the pitiful insects take over? Who keeps all the clocks running? Who cleans all the windows and oils all the door hinges? Who makes the tea?</i><br /> <br /> <i>Who is living in our poor deceased God's house now, my young friend?</i>&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T03:09:00-08:00","id":358988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Guancyto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=358837#post358837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, it's something from the forum game that eventually spawned the webcomic Kill Six Billion Demons, but it is Exalted's cosmology personified:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;God is Dead</i>, you say, simply, savoring the dark fire of the meta-Brandy and the beautiful bloody slash of the infinite ahead of you. Already her destination is materializing around you, inch by inch.<br /> <br /> <i>I was wrong to stop there</i>, you continue, <i> first, because this is common knowledge now. God died at the moment of His creation. I have slept in his corpse.</i><br /> <br /> You take another draft.<br /> <br /> <i>But the real question, </i> you say, and this is the real ringer, <i> is what happens to God's house after he dies? Do the mice and the rats and the pitiful insects take over? Who keeps all the clocks running? Who cleans all the windows and oils all the door hinges? Who makes the tea?</i><br /> <br /> <i>Who is living in our poor deceased God's house now, my young friend?</i>&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Man, I really, really hope that Nietzsche appears in the current incarnation of Kill Six Billion Demons.<br /> Mostly because I want to see Allison's reaction to meeting someone she knows from her history, whose philosophy she has likely read.<br /> But also because it's Friedrich Wilhelm Nietzsche.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T18:51:26-08:00","id":368127,"title":"","content":"No update, unfortunately, but while looking through the author's tumblr, I found a new sketch of the Seven with names listed and in the notes section, some of their titles.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orbitaldropkick.tumblr.com/post/107878216241/another-sketch-of-the-big-7-masters-of-the\" target=\"_blank\">Link.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T19:17:51-08:00","id":368153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nervaqus987</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=368127#post368127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No update, unfortunately, but while looking through the author's tumblr, I found a new sketch of the Seven with names listed and in the notes section, some of their titles.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orbitaldropkick.tumblr.com/post/107878216241/another-sketch-of-the-big-7-masters-of-the\" target=\"_blank\">Link.</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Huh, apparently I had Jadis and Gog-Agog confused. Welp.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T06:51:43-08:00","id":369716,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/?comic=ksbd-4-74\" target=\"_blank\">Update</a><br /> <br /> 4 become 5<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/QyEVQDY.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","user":"doran","date":". 01-14-2015, 02:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T08:56:46-08:00","id":369780,"title":"","content":"Kill Six Billion Demons has an article on io9. <a href=\"http://io9.com/warning-this-sumptuous-demon-filled-webcomic-may-brea-1679344609\" target=\"_blank\">http://io9.com/warning-this-sumptuou...rea-1679344609</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T09:45:17-08:00","id":369812,"title":"","content":"The increased traffic from the io9 article appears to be borking KSBD's server.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2497-brian888","name":"Brian888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T09:53:51-08:00","id":369818,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=345680#post345680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Seven may or may not be color coded. (I'm fairly certain about the names and possibly the identities.)</div> </div> </div> </div>They are, and the colors identify each of them with one of the Seven Deadly Sins.<br /> <br /> Mottom is orange, which is the color of Gluttony (pretty obvious).<br /> <br /> Mammon is yellow, which is the color of Greed. We haven't met him/it yet, but given his name, that makes sense.<br /> <br /> Incubus is white/light pink (I'm a little color-blind so it's hard for me to tell), which in some formulations is the color of Lust (in others it's blue, but that is clearly associated with Jadis). We haven't met him either, but given his name and the fact that he sent his official consort, it again makes sense.<br /> <br /> Solomon David (who I have to believe is the Biblical Solomon from some version of Earth) is purple, which is the color of Pride. He does seem like a smug fellow.<br /> <br /> Gog-Agog is green, which (all together now) is the color of Envy. <br /> <br /> Jagganoth is red, which is the color of Wrath. Seems fitting for him.<br /> <br /> Jadis (who appears to be frozen/encased in that big block/coffin thing) is blue, which is the color of Sloth (if it's not the color of Lust). Given her current state, that also seems to fit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2497-brian888","name":"Brian888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T11:08:16-08:00","id":369878,"title":"","content":"I wonder what's the story behind them leaving the central throne empty. Also, that's an interesting layout, Brian888.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T11:32:03-08:00","id":369894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=369878#post369878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder what's the story behind them leaving the central throne empty. Also, that's an interesting layout, Brian888.</div> </div> </div> </div>I assumed the empty throne was Zoss's old throne, and that the Demiurges leave it empty as part of their truce (i.e., none of them will attempt to claim it and assert dominion over the others). Jagganoth appears to me to be rethinking that agreement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2497-brian888","name":"Brian888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T11:52:57-08:00","id":377405,"title":"","content":"New comic!<br /> <br /> In which, the plot moves on and Mottom has had enough of Gog-Agog's shit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T12:02:53-08:00","id":377429,"title":"","content":"I assume Gog-Agog is fine; if it were that easy for the Seven to kill each other, there wouldn't be seven of them.<br /> <br /> Mottom looks so <i>happy</i> to have an excuse to do it, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T13:55:17-08:00","id":377526,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=377429#post377429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I assume Gog-Agog is fine; if it were that easy for the Seven to kill each other, there wouldn't be seven of them.</div> </div> </div> </div>True enough.<br /> <br /> Plus, the title &quot;Queen of Worms&quot; and the....mess, leads me suspect that Gog-Agog isn't exactly the type of organism that would be overly impaired over the loss of a head.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Mottom looks so <i>happy</i> to have an excuse to do it, though. </div> </div> </div>I get the feeling that Mottom goes to sleep each night wishing that she could make it stick.<br /> <br /> But even if she can't, Gog-Agog seems like she'd make a delightful stress ball.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T03:33:05-08:00","id":377930,"title":"","content":"I like the sense that they have an almost ritualised tendency to accuse and deny one another of working against the collective.<br /> <br /> I'm having a bit of trouble parsing Jagganoth's sentence. Like, is he addressing the Thorn Knights, or just exclaiming at the presence of some as a prelude to his question about Allison's boyfriend?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Oh, wait; apparently, the Thorn Knights are a group led by the angel 6 Juggernaut Star Scours the Universe, so it seems like he's pointing them out as the ones who were crossing his territory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":158,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","user":"Isator Levi","date":". 01-22-2015, 06:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T03:46:21-08:00","id":377936,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nervaqus987</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=377526#post377526\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Plus, the title &quot;Queen of Worms&quot; and the....mess, leads me suspect that Gog-Agog isn't exactly the type of organism that would be overly impaired over the loss of a head.</div> </div> </div> </div>Looking at the art showing her prior to their dominance, there seems to be a conspicuous lack of an apparent face beneath that hood, which might suggest the one we see her with is more of an accessory.<br /> <br /> EDIT: That seems even more apparent, now that I look back on it and notice that there are other shifts in her appearance (the most prominent of which appears to be her sudden development of a bust). Somebody in the comments pointed out that her overall demeanor seems to shift to reflect the last person she was focused on, which seems to reflect her association with envy. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":158,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","user":"Isator Levi","date":". 01-22-2015, 07:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T06:08:26-08:00","id":377984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=377930#post377930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the sense that they have an almost ritualised tendency to accuse and deny one another of working against the collective.<br /> <br /> I'm having a bit of trouble parsing Jagganoth's sentence. Like, is he addressing the Thorn Knights, or just exclaiming at the presence of some as a prelude to his question about Allison's boyfriend?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Oh, wait; apparently, the Thorn Knights are a group led by the angel 6 Juggernaut Star Scours the Universe, so it seems like he's pointing them out as the ones who were crossing his territory.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, my reading of this latest update is that Jagganoth noticed a band of mercenary angels carrying Allison's boyfriend through his territory, stomped the angels, put the boyfriend into suspended animation/whatever, and called the meeting to find out what in the hell is going on. Presumably on the theory that only one of the Demiurges has enough clout to order something like this.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2497-brian888","name":"Brian888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T06:29:08-08:00","id":377995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brian888</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=377984#post377984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yeah, my reading of this latest update is that Jagganoth noticed a band of mercenary angels carrying Allison's boyfriend through his territory, stomped the angels, put the boyfriend into suspended animation/whatever, and called the meeting to find out what in the hell is going on. Presumably on the theory that only one of the Demiurges has enough clout to order something like this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which means that, assuming the Thorn Knights didn't put him into suspended animation first, the last thing Mr. Boyfriend saw before he entered into suspended animation was Jagganoth kicking a bunch of Angel butts.<br /> I imagine he will awaken screaming either way, but damn, this guy has got it much worse than Allison.<br /> <br /> I actually kind of hope Mr. Boyfriend wakes up soon. I'm actually intrigued to learn his name if nothing else, and he might eventually become quite important if only as a touchstone for Allison. I mean, he is presumably the only person in Throne with any connection to Allison's Earth.<br /> Except for Nietzsche, I am -convinced- that he is going to appear at some point in this version of the comic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T12:54:53-08:00","id":378301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kleptomania</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=377995#post377995\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Which means that, assuming the Thorn Knights didn't put him into suspended animation first, the last thing Mr. Boyfriend saw before he entered into suspended animation was Jagganoth kicking a bunch of Angel butts.<br /> I imagine he will awaken screaming either way, but damn, this guy has got it much worse than Allison.<br /> <br /> I actually kind of hope Mr. Boyfriend wakes up soon. I'm actually intrigued to learn his name if nothing else, and he might eventually become quite important if only as a touchstone for Allison. I mean, he is presumably the only person in Throne with any connection to Allison's Earth.<br /> Except for Nietzsche, I am -convinced- that he is going to appear at some point in this version of the comic.</div> </div> </div> </div>It looks like this comic is shaping up to be a nice inversion of the &quot;prince saves the princess&quot; trope. Allison clearly is gearing up to KILL SIX BILLION DEMONS, and her boyfriend (who, as far as I can tell, doesn't even have a name yet) looks like he's in dire need of rescuing.<br /> <br /> That being said, from the little we've seen of the boyfriend, he kind of seems like a dick to me. He was really putting the full-court press on Allison there at the beginning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2497-brian888","name":"Brian888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T20:22:02-08:00","id":378630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brian888</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=378301#post378301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That being said, from the little we've seen of the boyfriend, he kind of seems like a dick to me. He was really putting the full-court press on Allison there at the beginning.</div> </div> </div> </div>True enough. Which is why I think he isn't going to remain Allison's boyfriend.<br /> Don't get me wrong, she will probably still rescue him; but because she think's it's the right thing to do, and because he's the only remnant of the Earth she has left behind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T22:31:07-08:00","id":378735,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brian888</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=378301#post378301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That being said, from the little we've seen of the boyfriend, he kind of seems like a dick to me. He was really putting the full-court press on Allison there at the beginning.</div> </div> </div> </div>... I don't see it. It was obviously her first time, and he was eager. Is reassuring her and showing enthusiasm grounds for calling him a jerk? Seriously, he's talked in like <i>three</i> comics tops.<br /> <br /> Give the guy a chance, people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T08:44:28-08:00","id":379061,"title":"","content":"Do we know how old Allison and the boyfriend are supposed to be? I'm assuming mid-20s, since it looked like she had her own place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2497-brian888","name":"Brian888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T18:56:38-08:00","id":379737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brian888</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=379061#post379061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do we know how old Allison and the boyfriend are supposed to be? I'm assuming mid-20s, since it looked like she had her own place.</div> </div> </div> </div>In the MSPA forum version, she was a college sorority girl, I can't remember if they directly say her age there. I imagine that she's anywhere from 18-21, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":203,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","user":"Kleptomania","date":". 01-23-2015, 10:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T10:17:01-08:00","id":384312,"title":"","content":"Update.<br /> <br /> To the surprise of no one, Gog-Agog is not dead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T10:30:22-08:00","id":384337,"title":"","content":"So it seems that Allison's Earth might be under the jurisdiction of Mottom.<br /> <br /> Also that her boyfriend has his own place of significance.<br /> <br /> Which, looking back on it, would seem to make sense, as the Thorn Knights immediately carried him off right after decapitating Zoss, and before Allison had the Magus Gate implanted in her.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T11:57:38-08:00","id":384388,"title":"","content":"From the comments:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>It, Serpent</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m wondering if anyone here, including Abbadon, has read the Keys to the Kingdom series by Garth Nix? It just dawned on me that the general plot shares remarkably many elements with KSBD. The protagonist, an ordinary human from Earth, becomes the heir to the House, the center of the multiverse and thereby heir to all of creation. However, he must defeat the seven Trustees that have usurped it and claim their seven keys for himself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good YA series - the Trustees also correspond to the Seven Sins, with the pieces of the Will the seven virtues. Interestingly narrow virtue, is ALSO represented as a character flaw e.g. Patience is lazy, Diligence is terse and overbearing.<br /> <br /> <br /> On the latest update, I still can't work out how Gog-Agog's eye sclera work - maybe they are actually eggshell?<br /> Seems weird Zoss has apparently just died and given the Gate to Alison. Perhaps Mottom sent him forwards in time?<br /> <br /> Or each world has its own timeline - no universal time, and Magus Gate portalling inherently involves closed loop time travel?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T17:00:45-08:00","id":384606,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>doran</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=384388#post384388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or each world has its own timeline - no universal time, and Magus Gate portalling inherently involves closed loop time travel?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>That is what I would assume.<br /> That, or Zoss has been evading the Black Emperors for an aeon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T19:21:46-08:00","id":384709,"title":"","content":"Who wants to bet they gotthis wrong?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T19:37:29-08:00","id":384714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=384709#post384709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who wants to bet they gotthis wrong?</div> </div> </div> </div>Given that The Conquering King Zoss is currently chatting up Alison and calling her &quot;Kingling&quot;?<br /> <br /> I'm not gonna take that bet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T07:03:53-08:00","id":384977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kleptomania</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=384606#post384606\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That, or Zoss has been evading the Black Emperors for an aeon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given how long the Demiurges have apparently been running things, and that Zoss wasn't counted among their number after that big war, I think this is the answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2497-brian888","name":"Brian888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T08:29:30-08:00","id":392625,"title":"","content":"New issue is up! <br /> <br /> This is straight-up gorgeous art. The way Abbadon draws the glass coffin/block/whatever thing, with the prophecy appearing on its surface, is beautiful.<br /> <br /> On to the substance...it looks like Jadis is trying to say something, and can't quite finish her thought. Instead, it appears that the bald fellow is doing most of the heavy lifting on speaking and interpreting the prophecy. How much of it is accurate? Was Jadis actually trying to say that the boyfriend is the successor, or is she trying to say something else, and it's getting lost in translation?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2497-brian888","name":"Brian888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T08:42:52-08:00","id":392631,"title":"","content":"I'd like to think that Jadis is trying to say &quot;She, not He, you idiot.&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T09:37:15-08:00","id":392655,"title":"","content":"Re-reading this one and the last one, I think what Jadis is getting around to saying is &quot;He is the successor's boyfriend/lover.&quot; It'll be hilarious (not for the boyfriend) if she can't ever quite spit it out though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2497-brian888","name":"Brian888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T12:42:55-08:00","id":392901,"title":"","content":"While I enjoyed this one as much as ever, I think I loved the except from Meti's Sword Manual.<br /> <br /> In particular;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#e33b5a\">2. I am Meti, of no house but myself. In my 108th year I am surrounded by fools. My compatriots cling obsessively to their destiny, and my only apprentice is an idiot speck of a girl with more talent for eating than skill with the blade. <b>Therefore I have decided to die drowning in the boiling gore of my enemies, of which there are many.</b><br /> </span> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T12:53:26-08:00","id":392906,"title":"","content":"Oh, Meti is the best. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#e33b5a\">10. I hope that by reading this manual, you will be thoroughly encouraged to become a farmer.</span> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2497-brian888","name":"Brian888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T14:12:36-08:00","id":393019,"title":"","content":"I wonder if Maya is in that picture for any reason other than prominence among the bounty hunters chasing Alice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T15:57:51-08:00","id":393152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=393019#post393019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if Maya is in that picture for any reason other than prominence among the bounty hunters chasing Alice.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Possibly.<br /> <br /> On Abaddon's tumblr, she's described as, among other things, &quot;an insanely powerful swordswoman&quot; and Meti's Sword Manual mentions that her only apprentice is &quot;an idiot speck of a girl with more talent for eating than skill with the blade&quot;, which could be a reference to Maya.<br /> <br /> Even Eris Lo-Kai hasn't gotten that much attention and he's Vatra, which was 82's first guess for the identity of someone who could steal a Key.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T19:29:46-08:00","id":393336,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=393019#post393019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if Maya is in that picture for any reason other than prominence among the bounty hunters chasing Alice.</div> </div> </div> </div>She's one of the 108 who will follow in the Sucessor's wake.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T04:09:44-08:00","id":393638,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=393336#post393336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> She's one of the 108 who will follow in the Sucessor's wake.</div> </div> </div> </div>So in other words, yes?<br /> <br /> I know that the 108 stars are likely a reference to the bounty hunters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T18:43:51-08:00","id":403969,"title":"","content":"So how about that Offering, huh? Pretty amazing view.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T04:30:42-08:00","id":404378,"title":"","content":"So, it's like her special name?<br /> <br /> I wonder if the big guy is supposed to be YISUN.<br /> <br /> Also, did Alice hear that last part?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T04:48:02-08:00","id":404380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=404378#post404378\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, it's like her special name?<br /> <br /> I wonder if the big guy is supposed to be YISUN.<br /> <br /> Also, did Alice hear that last part?</div> </div> </div> </div>I suppose so, yes. Unless (Kill) Six Billion Demons was who the King originally intended, before settling for Allison, or something.<br /> <br /> As for the god, I speculate it is either Un-Hansa or Un-Yam.<br /> Actually, Un-Yam makes a lot of sense. Pretty much all we know of him in life is that he was called 'Yam the High'; this god is larger and higher up than all the others, save floating ones. And, of course, Allison just fell off from Yam's corpse before coming to this Voidy Place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T04:58:06-08:00","id":404387,"title":"","content":"Allison. That's her name; Alice was the slightly mistaken one. Must remember.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T05:12:18-08:00","id":404391,"title":"","content":"Ah, so the title is a name, not a mission.<br /> <br /> ...I could see an Abyssal called that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T06:22:24-08:00","id":404424,"title":"","content":"Nice, found an interview with the Author where <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.wikia.com/wiki/Thread:3228\" target=\"_blank\">he reveals a lot of spoilerish info.</a><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.wikia.com/wiki/Thread:3228\" target=\"_blank\">Into the mind of a mad genius</a><br /> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.wikia.com/wiki/Message_Wall:Vylus_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\">Vylus Wiki</a><br /> I spoke to Abbadon last night and here's what he told me. None of this stuff is controversial or overly spoiler-y, so I think it's okay for me to share.<ul><li>He has enough material right now for five more years of KSBD</li> <li>He wishes he gave the comic more urgency, wishes Allison could play a more active role since she doesn't have her own character yet</li> <li>A print copy of KSBD is set to come out mid to late 2015; he intends to revise, clean up, and color the early pages<ul><li>When this happens, he does not intend for the rate of the webcomic to change</li> </ul></li> <li>The ending of the first &quot;book&quot; is coming near; each &quot;book&quot; will have Allison spending time with primarily one person, including members of the Seven</li> <li>He knows the comic's full of errors, jokes that tends to happen when you finish at 4 AM</li> <li>Takes a lot of inspiration from readers, but lots of ideas are difficult to use, like a 30 foot monster made of ash and bones</li> <li>Jokes that he really just ripped off Buddhism and that he mainly spends time drawing dudes fighting each other when asked what he does</li> <li>Main cast is all female because he likes the idea behind female protagonists</li> <li>Jagganoth is as powerful as the rest of the Seven combined, but Zoss could &quot;shit on&quot; all of them</li> <li>Jagganoth is somewhere on the level of Superman or Goku, as he is truly immune to harm and has access to immense magical power<ul><li>Jagganoth was designed to avoid the dumb brute trope</li> </ul></li> <li>All of the Seven have mastered space-time</li> <li>Incubus is a dick that everyone loves to hate; his name was originally supposed to be Michael</li> <li>The Seven, including Zoss, are sympathetic characters when you learn their backstories</li> <li>Some of the Seven are implied to have been born during the Universal War</li> <li>The Universal War happened 3000-4000 years ago</li> <li>The Universal Conquest in the comic is just 2/3; the first was when Zoss conquered Throne and the third is the prophecy foretold by Jadis</li> <li>Throne is its own universe with hundreds of billions of people</li> <li>Devils and demons are now the same thing</li> <li>Sweetie Pie (the white one) and Honey Bunch (the black one) are actually devils and the first devils to be shown masked; they are coming back at a later time</li> <li>All devils are ruled by some scary motherfucker named Himself who is literally locked away in an obsidian coffin because he's too much of a beast; Himself is the only devil without a mask</li> <li>The Undying Lords are the kings of the undead</li> <li>The little blue devils running around Throne can be thought of as servants with menial tasks; when a summoner dies, the devils can often be left to their own devices</li> <li>The symbol on Maya's back and Incubus' chair is a reference to the &quot;Middle Army&quot;</li> <li>The many universes branch out from Throne like spokes on a Wheel; everything that is not a universe is considered part of the void</li> <li>When physical beings enter the void, they cease to exist unless they cast a shade, which is the black &quot;psychic imprint&quot; of a person</li> <li>When angels enter the physical realm, they manifest as white flame that explodes continuously unless bound to their armor</li> <li>Angels are said to have been born from the corpse of UN when the gods breathed life into the pieces of him</li> <li>Angels and devils reincarnate because they're born in the void; when people die their energy enters the void but only a select few have enough willpower to maintain their sanity</li> <li>Confirms the void is filled with god corpses</li> <li>YISUN's energy permeates all of reality (hence, the secret name of God is 'I') and is known as the Flame Perishable<ul><li>The Flame Perishable manifests in all living beings; it can be hot/cold and black/white: angels are cold and white, devils are hot and white, humans are (?) and black, and servants are (?) and black</li> </ul></li> <li>Servants are powerful and not passive as their name implies; they fulfill the same role as classical mythological entities and were the first to be made by the gods, hence the poem</li> <li>Praman Nand is a actually a servant; he calls Nand the Gate Keeper several times</li> <li>The Art involves &quot;lying to the face of God&quot; and is a reflection of how reality is an illusion</li> <li>Allison's boyfriend really doesn't have a name yet</li> <li>The Pursuers will team up later and fail miserably</li> </ul>That's all I can think of right now.<br /> <br /> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <ul><li><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.wikia.com/wiki/Message_Wall:Vylus_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\">Vylus Wiki</a><br /> Hahaha, the dude is straight nuts, but in a good way. He's frickin' hilarious and the kind of guy who takes 2 minutes to give a direct answer because he's excited about everything.<br /> I forgot to mention his creative style is very fluid. Lots of reader input and just making stuff up as he goes along, though there is an overarching storyline that's set in place.<br /> One of the challenges noted with the print copy is the difficulty in including bonus material. It may or may not make its way in.<br /> He also said he's moving back to the US in August to make his rounds on the comic convention circuit.<br /> Oh, oh. The summoning of devils. All devils belong to a mass of essence, for lack of a better word. To summon one, a devil must be bound to a mask and given a name. I think he said this falls in line with classical demonology because I read a series of books which just so happens to explore the same concept.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.wikia.com/wiki/Thread:3228#3\" target=\"_blank\">02:58, February 2, 2015</a><br /> <br /> <br /> </div></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T09:07:48-08:00","id":406751,"title":"","content":"Surprise update today! I totally didn't notice the random naked person in the previous comic. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/kbsd-4-80/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://killsixbilliondemons.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/KSBD80.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/kbsd-4-80/\" target=\"_blank\"> KBSD 4-80 &ndash; Kill Six Billion Demons </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/kbsd-4-80/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/kbsd-4-80/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T12:36:53-08:00","id":406887,"title":"","content":"This reminds me of how, when Kill la Kill had a couple of bits across two episodes in which Ryuko was entirely nude (albeit covered in blood crossed with anime anatomy), it made me feel that the concept of using a Kamui requiring confidence in being exposed and a metaphor for shedding the accoutrements of imposed social roles would have worked a lot better if it had her become actually naked (just where the Kamui colouring becomes her entire skin). After all, as this reminds us, there are contexts in which nudity is less titillating than certain forms of clothing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T16:12:30-08:00","id":407107,"title":"","content":"Interesting....<br /> <br /> When Alison was last seen, her soul(I think that's what she is right now) was bald. Now, she has hair again.<br /> <br /> Additionally, white cracks/lines/thingies seem to be crawling up her legs from the ground.<br /> <br /> Final thing I wanted to note, in Jadis's prophecy, Kill Six Billion Demons(Alison) is mentioned to wield &quot;the terrible Blade of Want&quot; and in the images of the Glass Coffin, Alison is seen with a vaguely sword shaped mass of light/energy in her hand. Maya is also depicted, wielding something that looks basically the same. Further, in Meti's Sword Manual, the Blade of Want is referenced under the section &quot;Mastering the Sword.&quot; In a previous except, Meti mentions her apprentice whom she describes as &quot;an idiot speck of a girl with more talent for eating than skill with the blade&quot; which may be a reference to Maya, who spent the vast majority of her time on screen eating.<br /> <br /> What this leads to believe is that Maya may come to be a teacher and ally for Alison, who teaches her to wield the Blade of Want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T09:17:34-08:00","id":410162,"title":"","content":"Offering<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/ksbd-5-1/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://killsixbilliondemons.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/KSBD81.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/ksbd-5-1/\" target=\"_blank\"> KSBD 5-81 &ndash; Kill Six Billion Demons </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/ksbd-5-