"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T09:21:05-08:00","id":410167,"title":"","content":"I'm just glad her room isn't pink or purple or yellow. Yay for breaking stereotypes!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T16:08:01-08:00","id":410676,"title":"","content":"&quot;Keep calm and carry on&quot; is probably to be considered a meme by now. I don't think we can infer much by it, other than maybe a certain geekiness. Which the Sailor Moon poster does nothing to dissuade.<br /> <br /> This is a pretty interesting move right here, though. This will be a new interesting was of showing how Allison will react to normality after seeing the vastness of Throne. Hell, how she'll react to a moment of god damn calm; she's been tossed to a meta world filled with divine beings, sold into slavery, participated in a demon brawl and been addressed by the Conquering King all in a couple days. Now she has the time to react.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, got to say, if Meti's incarnation in Exalted is not the Invincible Sword Princess, she's the greatest Abyssal the world has ever seen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 02-18-2015, 07:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https: