andom-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 04-16-2015, 12:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T21:41:46-07:00","id":481921,"title":"","content":"So far, Allison has mostly been along for the ride. I wager the coming part will contain more action from her side, and the nature of that action will reveal her Caste.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T21:47:10-07:00","id":481923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=481905#post481905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If this were Exalted, what type of Exalt would Allison be?<br /> <br /> I'm sort of thinking Solar fits, because 1. She wields a Key of Kings. 2. She was &quot;chosen&quot; by the former King of the multiverse, who's been missing for eons. 3. She has been asked to overthrow the current rulers of the multiverse.<br /> I'm not sure though. So far she has no magic except dimensional travel, and she hasn't done much. I can't begin to guess a caste.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know if we know enough yet to say Solar, though it does fit.<br /> Infernal could come to be more fitting later, though. If some more of the stuff from MSPA Forum version is brought back.<br /> Sidereal is also a possibility, albeit a more unlikely one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T07:38:19-07:00","id":482304,"title":"","content":"Yes, the MSPA version of Allison felt rather Infernal -- minus the part about being willing to make deals with demons!<br /> So far the only devil in this Allison is a non-character and in pieces. But maybe that'll change.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 04-16-2015, 10:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T08:45:51-07:00","id":482426,"title":"","content":"Well, <i>all </i>splats in Exalted are generally willing to make deals with demons. The Yozis' surrender oaths being what they are, the Exalts usually get the better end of this bargain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1024-thesaurasaurus","name":"Thesaurasaurus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T13:51:00-07:00","id":482738,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=481905#post481905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure though. So far she has no magic except dimensional travel, and she hasn't done much. I can't begin to guess a caste.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, All-Ys-Un is currently capable of lightly punching the shower wall and leaving a little crater there, so she definitely has super-strength of some sort. And the key has the power to literally split worlds, if Ciocie can be trusted. She just has to learn how to use it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1516-solarious","name":"Solarious","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T14:20:03-07:00","id":482806,"title":"","content":"She's going back right away? Hardcore. I would have expected an arc on Earth here, to tell us more about her background. Then again, maybe the air of mystery surrounding Throne is best kept on Earth as well.<br /> <br /> Let me get the tweets correct. The one from the 22nd of May is when she goes to sleep with Zaid. Then, the 25th of May, the returns to Earth and tweets out that she's off to the Grand Canyon so that no one bothers her while she's dealing with her trauma. Now, after an unknown period of time on Earth but presumably with plenty of time left on those two weeks, she returns to Throne to find Zaid.<br /> <br /> Look at her shaking with that sword, though. She could use picking up Meti's manual is all I'm sayin'.<br /> <br /> Speaking of stuff she's not so good at, do we even know she can travel back? So far, the journey there was arranged by the Conquering King and the journey back was hardly deliberate. Has she internalized the Magus Gate sufficiently to use it on her own? At least now she clearly wants something, which seems to be a key to causing Division, so that's a bonus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 04-16-2015, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T14:24:15-07:00","id":482812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=482806#post482806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She's going back right away? Hardcore. I would have expected an arc on Earth here, to tell us more about her background. Then again, maybe the air of mystery surrounding Throne is best kept on Earth as well.<br /> <br /> Let me get the tweets correct. The one from the 22nd of May is when she goes to sleep with Zaid. Then, the 25th of May, the returns to Earth and tweets out that she's off to the Grand Canyon so that no one bothers her while she's dealing with her trauma. Now, after an unknown period of time on Earth but presumably with plenty of time left on those two weeks, she returns to Throne to find Zaid.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I assumed that she is tweeting that she is going to the Grand Canyon to explain where she is going right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T14:30:05-07:00","id":482816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Solarious</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=482738#post482738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, All-Ys-Un is currently capable of lightly punching the shower wall and leaving a little crater there, so she definitely has super-strength of some sort.</div> </div> </div> </div>We can't really rule out the possibility that her shower wall is cheap garbage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/587-kukla","name":"Kukla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar587_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T14:58:39-07:00","id":482833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kukla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=482816#post482816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We can't really rule out the possibility that her shower wall is cheap garbage.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or that the strength boosts are effected by her emotional state. She is calm now which is why she is having trouble with the Zwi hander.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T15:33:19-07:00","id":482857,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=482812#post482812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I assumed that she is tweeting that she is going to the Grand Canyon to explain where she is going right now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I think so too. I just think she tweeted that right when she came home, rather than now when she's leaving again, and a few days of those two weeks have already passed.<br /> <br /> The question is how long she was in Throne, I suppose. <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/ksbd-5-1/\" target=\"_blank\">We know that she left her laundry in the washing machine for about three days</a>, which made me think she was there for that length of time. Or at least two days: she loaded the machine on the 22nd, then went off to Zaid's and expected to come home on the 23rd to empty it. Instead she went to Throne and spent the 23rd and 24th there, and she arrived home on the 25th. So she spent three (Earthly) days, two (Earthly) nights, in Throne.<br /> <br /> The alternative would be that she stayed shorter, maybe only two days and one night, and the tweet of the 25th is indeed made when she now departs again. However, <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/ksbd-2-1/\" target=\"_blank\">we know that she she took some time to recuperate </a>after her entry, and it would have to have caused all that happened in Throne to be events of little more than a day. It would also cause her to have only spent one day on Earth again, which I find strange. Surely you'd need a bit of rest after that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T03:43:33-07:00","id":483391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=329711#post329711\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Granted, the Conquering King might simply have been confused by Allison's name and thought that she was Alice-un, with a suffix that just didn't match her gender.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Although come to think of it, he may be getting her name wrong, but how does he know it at all?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ultra-belatedly, I was rereading that page and thought of something: If he was watching her all along somehow, then he might have seen her &quot;I have a fucking name&quot; to 82, and tried to call her by her name out of respect for that.<br /> <br /> That is now my headcanon, since there's something so <i>cute</i> about the half-dead barely-coherent fallen Conquering King struggling to call Alison by her name on account of that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T06:17:53-07:00","id":490451,"title":"","content":"There's not been a new update this Wednesday, but I wanted to point out that according to <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/the-42215-update-and-looking-forward/#comments\" target=\"_blank\">this blog post</a>, there has kind of been an old update. Abbadon has gone over the dialogue and tightened it up so that it's not quite as hard to follow some of the turns in the earlier parts of the comic (while still maintaining the &quot;thrown right in&quot; feeling). He says that there might be further edits, and he'll look at some of the artwork as well. Apparently, it's part of an effort to shape the pages up for a printed book release sometime in the latter part of this year.<br /> <br /> Edit: <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/ksbd-2-23/\" target=\"_blank\">Turns out there has been a new page inserted, just not at the end.</a> Time is an illusion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 04-24-2015, 09:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T06:31:34-07:00","id":490464,"title":"","content":"Huh. I'd never actually wondered why 82 brought Allison to Cio rather than doing something more... &quot;law-abiding&quot; before, but with hindsight it does seem to have been a slight plot hole, and this elaboration is useful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T06:43:50-07:00","id":490470,"title":"","content":"That explains a lot! I assumed that I was missing the plot somewhere that everyone else was gettng. I guess it was an emperor's new clothes scenario. We were all distracted by the pretty artwork. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T06:46:33-07:00","id":490472,"title":"","content":"Oh! I thing I thought of at one point, but never remembered to bring up:<br /> <br /> So, the Seven are supposed to have comprehensive mastery over time and space, and Zoss is supposed to outdo them even in that regard.<br /> <br /> It's not yet been clearly established what that might mean, although it would probably at least include comic-book superpower style local time manipulation.<br /> <br /> But, given the nature of this story and setting, the metaphysics and cosmology, the capacity for it to be something more elaborate and esoteric...<br /> <br /> I'm wondering if at least one application is the fact that Zoss can till be around in a certain capacity even after he was apparently killed. I don't think it strictly involves time travel (and the predestination paradox headaches that would entail, considering the circumstances), perhaps more that they don't quite need to pass through time linearly. Or at least that their linear time is on a certain different plane to that of those who don't have such power.<br /> <br /> So it might be that from the perspective of Zoss as he gave Allison her name, his own decapitation might be somewhere in his own future, inevitable but still far off.<br /> <br /> Although, given the term &quot;complete mastery of space-time&quot;, what if a demiurge (wielding a Key of Kings?) is able to stretch out the space between the current moment and the one of their death to an almost indefinite degree? The idea that somewhere in the multiverse, the moment of your death exists, and you'll catch up to it eventually, but it doesn't really impact your capacity to still be around long after and far away from it, at your own discretion.<br /> <br /> Although power over a Magus Gate might make it easier to make such a death stick. At the very least, I'd say their monopoly on that power is why the Seven came out on top, and why Allison is going to need it to kill them.<br /> <br /> I'm probably overthinking this a bit, but if nothing else I think some of the ideas are interesting. I think the most straightforward details for the moment are &quot;mastery of space-time means you don't necessarily die when you're killed&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avata