lows would be taken in by such a thing.<br /> <br /> 2 Michael... I'm assuming that some clarity is forthcoming, but for now I'm going to assume that &quot;Secondborn&quot; refers to the generation of angels following those who were slain by the Demiurges, of which Michael (the only one of what I'm presuming are Firstborn to reincarnate) is a leader and possible creator/instigator.<br /> <br /> Either that or Secondborn still refers to the angels in general, and Michael has the distinction of not only being the first of their first generation, but also the only 'survivor'.<br /> <br /> Although, recalling the origin story that White Chain gave, in which the demiurges made new bodies for the angels...<br /> <br /> It might be that the angels initially existed in their gigantic forms (presumably made by the gods and goddesses) which were slain, and then the Demiurges made the smaller humanoid bodies to contain the white flame (either recycling the souls of the original angels into smaller forms or drawing new fire from the void), and Michael is the only one of the original angels incarnated in the bodies made by Demiurges.<br /> <br /> Hmmm...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T10:04:33-07:00","id":521974,"title":"","content":"God, it's been so long since I've watched Hellsing, I'd 