"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=593737#post593737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Here you go!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://mspaforums.com/showthread.php?47341-KILL-SIX-BILLION-DEMONS-%28NSFW%29-NOW-A-FRUITY-WEBCOMIC\" target=\"_blank\">http://mspaforums.com/showthread.php...RUITY-WEBCOMIC</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Wow.<br /> <br /> That is quite the odd thread isn't it? My eyes. They feel dry and kinda square from just staring in fascination of the growing artistic skill, weird plot and even weirder suggestions from the members posting. WTF.<br /> <br /> It makes K6BD as a weekly thing on it's own look positively sane ... But I'm sorely tempted to create a game/Exalted Shard based on such skull-fuggery and weirdness. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/907-jay","name":"Jay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T09:42:23-07:00","id":635927,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/glory-to-the-divine-corpse/\" target=\"_blank\">New (retroactive) page.</a><br /> <br /> I love how it has to <i>specify</i> that there's only a single sun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":97,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","user":"The MG","date":". 08-22-2015, 12:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T10:07:35-07:00","id":635982,"title":"","content":"Beautiful.<br /> And very Exalted. It's as if Yu-Shan and the Threshold have been condensed into a single, wretched hive of scum and villainy.<br /> <br /> I am thankful for some further explanation of the City and I'm sure Allison is, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 08-22-2015, 01:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T10:15:07-07:00","id":635983,"title":"","content":"I'd always wondered what the layout of the city was in terms of the whole thing with the hundreds of thousands of gods arranged in a circle (especially considering how the semi-canon set of facts given before gave the population as being in the billions or something), so it's nice to see how it's all actually laid out (as well as the relatively more sensible figure for the world-city). Given how it's likely that Allison's adventure has only taken place somewhere at that bottom level so far, it's interesting to think that there's an enormous central hive yet to be visited. It's also good to have some more firm context for what exactly the guilds are in the scheme of things (I mean, maggots of the divine corpse is apt, but was still a bit ambiguous).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T11:41:43-07:00","id":636115,"title":"","content":"Also something to note, the second chapter is now fully colored..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T13:24:56-07:00","id":636226,"title":"","content":"<i>True</i> king? Since when are things <i>true</i> in this setting? God herself is &quot;perhaps&quot;, but Zoss is <i>true</i>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;They&quot; is an excellent gender neutral pronoun.<br /> Avatar adapted from art by Cordell Felix <a href=\"http://cordellfelix.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://cordellfelix.com/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1177-arrghus","name":"Arrghus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1177_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T13:45:41-07:00","id":636244,"title":"","content":"Zoss breached the firmament and tamed Heaven by might alone. He is a mortal paragon of Want, and that makes him true <i>enough</i>.<br /> <br /> (YISUN, by definition, is not the true anything, because YISUN is the most sublime liar.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T13:55:16-07:00","id":636250,"title":"","content":"Zoss was certainly the Conquering King and the Ruling King. Being the true one might at least be 82's opinion. She insists that there's value in humanity as well without that needing to be an unambiguous truth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T14:06:54-07:00","id":636261,"title":"","content":"That, too. Actually, mostly that.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T14:21:08-07:00","id":636273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love how it has to specify that there's only a single sun.</div> </div> </div> </div> I think... that sun may not move. Notice how the left side of Throne is in shadow, and the area closest to the Red City is called the Shades. It might be that that area is in permanent dark. I want to model the Blessed Isle off of this picture...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T14:40:49-07:00","id":636281,"title":"","content":"I'm not so sure that shadow is permanent. After all, there's talk about &quot;turns&quot; as a unit of time, and it seems roughly equivalent to twenty-four hours.<br /> <br /> The sun might still be immobile, mind you. Throne is, after all, the hub of the Wheel; it would only be appropriate that <i>it</i> turn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-23T03:31:57-07:00","id":636858,"title":"","content":"I like it when these retroactive posts give me reason to reread the earlier parts of the comic, because Allison's (entirely reasonable) reaction to Hell 71 can make it easy to forget how her initial reaction to a lot of stuff was a lot more angry and snarky and inquisitive. Like when she woke up in 82's apartment and expressed herself with outrage and throwing a coffee pot at her and taking the whole &quot;person made of stone&quot; and &quot;magically able to speak a new language&quot; things in relative stride.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-23T09:02:43-07:00","id":637073,"title":"","content":"I'm going to reread the whole thing once the retroactive changes and coloring are all done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","