icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=679769#post679769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why do people keep making posts to repeat the exact same things I have said...</div> </div> </div> </div>Because I had this thread on an open tab for a while and didn't see that you had posted before I did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T03:43:26-07:00","id":681899,"title":"","content":"Has anybody else gotten a look at this RPG draft yet? I'm perusing it at the moment, but just wanted to say that it made one little point that answered a question I had before; the King's Road is basically the term for the transition between different worlds as well as the Void.<br /> <br /> Considering that against some of the statements and happenings in the comic... it seems as though most of the time when one wants to move between worlds, they pass through a King's Gate or harness their Magus Gate, wind up upon the King's Road, and then need to literally travel along it until they reach their destination.<br /> <br /> So it also seems as though part of the power of a Key of Kings might be being able to make this journey fairly rapidly; Allison being dragged back and forth between her Earth and Throne doesn't seem to have been instantaneous (the colourised early issues makes it clear that she was travelling upon the Road during that initial trip rather than just teleporting), but it still seems to have entailed little travelling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T04:26:37-07:00","id":681915,"title":"","content":"I don't have money to spend on the Patreon, unfortunately.<br /> <br /> I guess <a href=\"http://orbitaldropkick.tumblr.com/image/130116736436\" target=\"_blank\">these</a> are the classes, so to speak?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T04:38:23-07:00","id":681924,"title":"","content":"Yeah, they're the &quot;character play sheets&quot;, as they're called. I have an exam tomorrow so I've only glanced at it, but I'll check it out as soon as I can.<br /> <br /> It should be noted that Abbadon doesn't seem to mind it getting spread around. From the Patreon post: &quot;I'm not keeping this under wraps - I'm posting it only to $10/month or higher patrons only as promised since its an early copy, but you're more than welcome to pass it off to anyone who wants a copy - the final book will be free after all.&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://s3-us-west-1.amazonaws.com/patreon.posts/nLReUxgKwgx43ndGxlPeYrQtvURhrLWJgDqt6qYdTwM0ZRA0lNPwfnWWvlgjPXr9/KSBD_RPGv1.0.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">So I guess I could just post the pdf link here, question mark?</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 09-29-2015, 08:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T05:54:41-07:00","id":681973,"title":"","content":"Coolio.<br /> <br /> Ah, it's Apocalypse World-based. That explains it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T01:37:21-07:00","id":682826,"title":"","content":"New page.<br /> <br /> Allison just can't get enough of these bad decisions, can she?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T02:11:32-07:00","id":682839,"title":"","content":"I personally like how the story is giving her actual agency at this stage, including the agency to screw up. Under the circumstances, I feel it doesn't make her look incompetent so much as trying to learn the ropes on her own terms, rather than being pushed or pulled around by others. Even the apparent mission given to her by Zoss is something she's thus far given little thought to, because so far it doesn't really have anything to do with her.<br /> <br /> Besides, given the nature of this cosmology, her ignorance may prove to be an asset.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T14:16:28-07:00","id":683545,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-1-17/\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a>.<br /> <br /> I thought it curious that there's no mechanical difference between the four races in the pdf, seeing as how some of them certainly have powers that others lack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T14:18:06-07:00","id":683546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=683545#post683545\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I thought it curious that there's no mechanical difference between the four races in the pdf, seeing as how some of them certainly have powers that others lack.</div> </div> </div> </div>The different races get different benefits based on their class.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T14:20:40-07:00","id":683548,"title":"","content":"It's a rules-light (sort of) indie system. Kind of comes with territory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attach