.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1982-spacepup","name":"Spacepup","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-03T00:19:09-07:00","id":686635,"title":"","content":"This devil can reach out of one panel and into another.<br /> <br /> I can only imagine how that must look.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-03T08:14:39-07:00","id":687061,"title":"","content":"Here's a different angel name generator by somebody else:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=http://pastebin.com/raw.php?i=8Vja9JPT\" target=\"_blank\">http://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/...php?i=8Vja9JPT</a><br /> <br /> Does anyone else wonder if &quot;Wielder of Names&quot; means that Alison has the power to give or remove Devils' names? I'm imagining her discovering that the ebon devil has cheated, trying to insult him in anger, accidentally giving him 4-5 new names, and turning him into a blue devil.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 10-03-2015, 12:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-04T04:16:05-07:00","id":688120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacepup</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=686389#post686389\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm, is it weird that I'm actually kind of getting good vibes from this guy? He's a little creepy with his long limbs, but his &quot;ho hm' and lots of pauses makes me have a knee-jerk reaction to make me think of treebeard, and I loved that guy. I can even hear his lines in Treebeard's voice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking as a Swede, he reminds me of the old stories about mountain trolls, which... well, they're not very nice creatures. Classic Fair folk, and powerful ones, at that. Vulnerable only to sunlight, of which there is precious little in the Void.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;They&quot; is an excellent gender neutral pronoun.<br /> Avatar adapted from art by Cordell Felix <a href=\"http://cordellfelix.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://cordellfelix.com/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1177-arrghus","name":"Arrghus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1177_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-04T08:48:54-07:00","id":688379,"title":"","content":"So in summary, yes, Spacepup, it is weird you're kind of getting good vibes from this guy. He just made an enforcable deal with Allison to play games for the shine in her head... and given that a Magus Key is unlikely to be easily to be split, we're talking about having it ripped out of her head, <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/ksbd-3-47/\" target=\"_blank\">al dante</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1516-solarious","name":"Solarious","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-04T11:31:08-07:00","id":688551,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Solarious</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=688379#post688379\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So in summary, yes, Spacepup, it is weird you're kind of getting good vibes from this guy. He just made an enforcable deal with Allison to play games for the shine in her head... and given that a Magus Key is unlikely to be easily to be split, we're talking about having it ripped out of her head, <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/ksbd-3-47/\" target=\"_blank\">al dante</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Granted, there has been some chatter in the comments that, due to the phrasing, Alison may be able to sub out &quot;Key of Kings&quot; for &quot;Blond hair dye&quot; if she loses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-04T12:31:46-07:00","id":688610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nervaqus987</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=688551#post688551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Granted, there has been some chatter in the comments that, due to the phrasing, Alison may be able to sub out &quot;Key of Kings&quot; for &quot;Blond hair dye&quot; if she loses.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would probably make the Ebon devil a bit mad. Do you really want an Ebon devil mad at you? Granted, it'll give Allison a start on her sobriquet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1516-solarious","name":"Solarious","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-04T12:47:30-07:00","id":688622,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't bet on a creature whose power derives from millenia of bargaining to fall for something that basic.<br /> <br /> Nevermind that the hair dye, by its very nature, isn't <i>in</i> Allison's head.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-04T13:27:03-07:00","id":688682,"title":"","content":"Didn't she have some of the alcohol? Considering that gets into the blood, there may be some 'shine in her head of a different sort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":