],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-10T18:44:07-08:00","id":762749,"title":"","content":"Hmmm.... So Cio was a color other than blue at one point. <br /> <br /> Good to see Oscar!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-10T21:33:43-08:00","id":762829,"title":"","content":"I assumed every demon starts out Pallid before they can become Blue, so it doesn't necessarily mean she used to be a higher color.<br /> Edit: Wait, no, if you drink blue devil liquor a blue one grows in your stomach. Though I suppose it could be a &quot;reincarnation&quot; of one who was banished to the Void? How does &quot;reincarnation&quot; work for angels and devils?<br /> <br /> I like how the crying red devil has another one patting him on the shoulder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 11-11-2015, 12:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-10T22:01:51-08:00","id":762840,"title":"","content":"Could anyone remind me who this is?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T01:29:27-08:00","id":762916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=762840#post762840\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could anyone remind me who this is?</div> </div> </div> </div>Character from proto-KSBD, from when it was a thread in the MSPA forum. Name is Oscar, has a neat coat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T02:23:19-08:00","id":762942,"title":"","content":"Earlier on, when Cio is explaining a few things about devils, we see that group of summoners talking with a red devil with a visibly decaying mask, and they're offering him a new one of the same colour, so I presume that a demon's names/mask require certain sustenance, without which they might need to either fall back on their old masks or bargain with summoners from a position of weakness in which they'll likely have to accept additional names.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T07:29:42-08:00","id":763093,"title":"","content":"Considering Cio's seemingly* small amount of names for a blue devil, I'm more inclined to believe she was once a greater demon since diminished back to blue.<br /> <br /> White Chain sought Cio out because she is apparently the only one to have ever successfully stolen a Key Of Kings, but she evidently doesn't have the key still, and we don't have any further context. Which begs the question of the aftermath. Is it possible she was lessened (perhaps from gold or green even) as a punishment when she was caught?<br /> <br /> *At least according to quotes from the treaty/manual on demons that we were seeing at the start of the chapter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T13:48:19-08:00","id":763416,"title":"","content":"I find it really interesting that devils can apparently go <i>down</i> on the metaphorical power ladder as well as up.<br /> <br /> When Vladok said that his power was old and waning, I figured he was basically going &quot;Oh, look at me. I'm old and weak, and you can <i>totally</i> take me.&quot;<br /> <br /> But given that red devil who mentioned that he used to be gold before it &quot;grew old and shrunk&quot;, that may mean that he wasn't completely bluffing out Alison.<br /> <br /> So maybe devils have to do the occasional &quot;maintenance&quot; work on their names to keep their power and can't just rest on their laurels after getting to Ebon.<br /> <br /> Also of interest, Oscar mentioning that Cio &quot;looks good in blue.&quot; Meaning she probably dropped down there from a few rungs up the ladder. Way back when, White Chain mentioned that Cio had once stolen a Magnus Gate. I've always kinda wondered how a blue devil could have pulled something like that off. But apparently, she wasn't always blue.<br /> <br /> And as a side note, with the general metaphysics behind devils, I'm sorta wondering if you couldn't slot them into the Wyld. Possibly replacing the raksha.<br /> <br /> After all, the emphasis on names and gaining them and through them, power, reminds me of how raksha are supposed gain power from their own stories.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":446,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","user":"Nervaqus987","date":". 11-11-2015, 06:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T13:54:46-08:00","id":763425,"title":"","content":"I assumed the ebon devil was just lying to trick Allison. But I suppose it's possible that he's doing this just to prop up his reputation so he can keep his status. With the chance to gain a Magus Gate as a nice side benefit, of course.<br /> <br /> And yes, they do feel a little like Wyld Creatures. I would change them a bit though to fit them into Exalted: they are a flame of chaos that must chain and mask and name themselves to play in Creation. It isn't imposed by humans but by the Gateway of Sundraprisha. Unlike Raksha, they maintain themselves in Creation by... whatever it is they need to do to remain famous and keep their name and mask polished.<br /> <br /> You may be right about replacing Raksha, though -- the theme of tricking humans into deals, and doing outrageous dramatic stuff for the sake of being dramatic, may overlap too much with the Raksha. Then again, their magic and &quot;assumptions&quot; could be vastly different from each other. They could also be differentiated by not being dedicated to destroying the universe and everyone in it, and not being able to feed on people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T21:03:25-08:00","id":765328,"title":"","content":"That is one fine coat.<br /> <br /> <b>And</b> the return of Sweetie Pie and Honey Bunch? Such <i>angels.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9258-col","name":"CoL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-14T17:08:23-08:00","id":765884,"title":"","content":"I had wondered about those two. I mean, they didn't seem to quite match the established schema, and here we see them coming across as quite different to other demons in the Void. Plus, now that the rank and system has been laid out in the narrative, it makes it quite explicit that they are distinct from it; their masks are unlike the masks of other demons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-14T17:22:18-08:00","id":765896,"title":"","content":"Yeah, good point. I took them for Pallid but those masks are humanoid, not insectoid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style