ut is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T19:26:07-08:00","id":780862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=780860#post780860\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I sure hope Princess Mamoru Jagermeister Jack Jack Daniels Timothy Tim Fred (whatever) Luna, Esquire returns.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm half expecting her to come back, having advanced in color once again and seeking bloody vengeance upon Alison.<br /> <br /> And will promptly be told to get in line because there's gonna be a whole lot of people out for revenge whom Alison left broken and ruined in her wake.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T22:38:40-08:00","id":780941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=780801#post780801\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reputation. All of those demons were hailing Allison as she left. Word will get around that she beat an Ebon Demon.</div> </div> </div> </div>I went back and reread the scene, and it appears that its all because Cio wouldn't risk certain death to take her to the flying castle. I accept this as a valid answer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T23:09:27-08:00","id":780954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=780941#post780941\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I went back and reread the scene, and it appears that its all because Cio wouldn't risk certain death to take her to the flying castle. I accept this as a valid answer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh! I didn't realize what you were asking. Reputation is the meta effect, in terms of &quot;what did this do narratively in terms of moving the story forwards&quot; (as well as giving Allison a chance to shine.)<br /> <br /> The proximate reason was that Cio refused to take her there, yes. I don't think it's so much that Cio didn't want to risk certain death as it is that Cio thought Allison's plan of giving the key to Mottom was idiotic. (And it is. It's not even clear Allison <i>can</i> give the key away without dying.) But presumably she's either decided that Allison is tough enough to survive her own mistakes, or has some other plan in mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T05:09:04-08:00","id":781075,"title":"","content":"That bird has very sharp hair.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T00:33:11-08:00","id":782666,"title":"","content":"Update.<br /> <br /> Fun fact, Abaddon mentioned in an interview a while back that the Pursuers would team up and fail miserably.<br /> <br /> I somewhat doubt that they'll end up getting quite as screwed over as say, an Ebon Devil getting his ass dropped back down Blue, but they're probably not going have a good time of things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T01:20:00-08:00","id":782683,"title":"","content":"It's interesting to have a direct visual on which ones are human and which ones aren't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T03:42:27-08:00","id":782719,"title":"","content":"Where's the gunwitch?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T04:15:36-08:00","id":782724,"title":"","content":"She's sitting on her broom. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T12:10:51-08:00","id":782979,"title":"","content":"So <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.tumblr.com/post/134843864225/i-was-under-the-assumption-that-servants-had-black\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> is an interesting thing Abbadon said. It's nice to have a confirmation that detail of worldbuilding is actually outdated now. It had been bugging me for a bit, and this does make more sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T14:29:05-08:00","id":783053,"title":"","content":"I'm just surprised that Maya casts a shade rather than a body.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T15:42:48-08:00","id":783092,"title":"","content":"Why is that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T16:30:09-08:00","id":783118,"title":"","content":"She's most likely the apprentice of Meti. If I've interpreted the Sword Manual correctly, this would make her a contemporary of the Black Emperors.<br /> <br /> And even if not, &quot;the conqueror of 20000 worlds&quot; is exactly who I would expect to have a strong soul flame.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T02:53:55-08:00","id":783324,"title":"","content":"Do even demiurges cast bodies into the Void? Zoss seems to, but he's apparently mighty even by their standards.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T10:09:16-08:00","id":783499,"title":"","content":"The Demiurges do- we saw their meeting in the void way back when.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T10:34:07-08:00","id":783508,"title":"","content":"I don't think the Concordance of the Demiurges took place in the Void. For one thing, Zaid also had a body there; does he have a super-powerful soul as well? Not to mention all of the retainers they have with them. For another, when the shot pans out, all of those god corpses look about as solid as they do in the rest of Throne, in contrast to that more fluid white substance in the backdrop of that shot of naked shade Allison.<br /> <br /> Then there's the fact that on that map of Throne on one of the retroactively inserted pages, it points to the part of the city in which the Concordance takes place.<br /> <br /> I went back to look at that page, and it looks to me more like the part of Throne at which the Concordance takes place is visible from the King's Road, but is not itself part of the Void.<br /> <br /> Besides, given some of the lore text given, I would wonder if how powerful you are as a person has much to do with the substance of your soul at all.<br /> <br /> Zoss seemed to be physical to Allison that one time, but he was also possibly kind of dead at that point, so I think there may have been some shenanigans going on at the time. Time travel? Mental projection? Actually being dead and being in the place where souls go, albeit with a unique capacity to hold himself together? It's not enough to make a comprehensive statement, I think.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T10:40:38-08:00","id":783513,"title":"","content":"Didnt the concordance take place on top of Un-Hansa's head?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T11:43:23-08:00","id":783556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Zoss seemed to be physical to Allison that one time, but he was also possibly kind of dead at that point, so I think there may have been some shenanigans going on at the time. Time travel? Mental projection? Actually being dead and being in the place where souls go, albeit with a unique capacity to hold himself together? It's not enough to make a comprehensive statement, I think. </div> </div> </div>He was embodied when he chased the primes into the Void, too.<br /> <br /> As for the Concordance, there I am inclined to agree with you. (I still think that Zaid might be the fated Kill Six Billion Demons, though, and therefore another candidate for a strong soul. The retainers, not so much.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-12T08:33:06-08:00","id":784766,"title":"","content":"So apparently those skull-faced beasts are actually <i><b>dead people</b></i>. Those are the same things we've seen in Throne and ridden by the Thorn Knights. I'm surprised to see the word <a href=\"http://magiccards.info/c15/en/235.html\" target=\"_blank\">Thrull</a> used.<br /> <br /> Evidently nobody has cars or trucks in the Conquered Worlds. I feel like if our Earth's Gate were opened, used-car salesmen and automakers would see a huge jump in profits.<br /> <br /> <br /> Aaand there are people impaled on huge spikes lining the Road. Presumably to remind everyone what happens if you offend the Demiurges.<br /> And is that an angel watching the Road?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-12T12:36:51-08:00","id":784911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">So apparently those skull-faced beasts are actually dead people.</div> </div> </div> </div> At least the ones that are black. Although... if the Servants are the white equivalent to humans, it's likely that all of them are sapient regardless of their form, so the white beasts are likely their own dead enslaved as well. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Those are the same things we've seen in Throne</div> </div> </div> </div> Which ones? It seems odd to reference the idea that turning the dead into beasts of burden is a great expense that has to be resorted to because animals can't enter the Void, and then have them used in the same way in material reality. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Evidently nobody has cars or trucks in the Conquered Worlds.</div> </div> </div> </div> I've seen a reference to the idea that the Seven suppress technology throughout their domains. Still, I like the way that Allison is incredulous over the notion of people walking between the multiverse. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">is that an angel watching the Road</div> </div> </div> </div> Looks like it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-12T14:44:25-08:00","id":784992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=784911#post784911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which ones? It seems odd to reference the idea that turning the dead into beasts of burden is a great expense that has to be resorted to because animals can't enter the Void, and then have them used in the same way in material reality.</div> </div> </div> </div>When Allison first falls into Throne, I think the street traffic includes those skull-faced Shades. I'm certain the Thorn Knights who attacked Zoss and abducted Zaid were riding Shades.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-12T16:19:36-08:00","id":785050,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=783556#post783556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for the Concordance, there I am inclined to agree with you. (I still think that Zaid might be the fated Kill Six Billion Demons, though, and therefore another candidate for a strong soul. The retainers, not so much.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Although the rest of what Isator says is accurate, I will say, if I were a nigh-invincible demiurge, I would make sure that even my retainers and hangers-on were exceptionally strong-willed and strong-souled. My rivals might subvert them otherwise!<br /> <br /> (Being <i>just</i> a retainer to one of the seven rulers of the multiverse should be an incredibly competitive position, after all.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-12T18:17:39-08:00","id":785098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the street traffic includes those skull-faced Shades. I'm certain the Thorn Knights who attacked Zoss and abducted Zaid were riding Shades.</div> </div> </div> </div> Yeah I see it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T05:12:51-08:00","id":785332,"title":"","content":"I don't think all the pack &quot;animals&quot; in this page are dead. People like the Kind Ones (Mammon's race) are already quadrupedal, so they could easily carry their own goods like that, and the prevalence of slavery in the broken world means that the big crawling thing could be, well, a slave.<br /> <br /> Actually, I suspect that the Servants don't die and leave shades the way humans do. We, after all, are the only true mortals.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=784911#post784911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It seems odd to reference the idea that turning the dead into beasts of burden is a great expense that has to be resorted to because animals can't enter the Void, and then have them used in the same way in material reality.</div> </div> </div> </div>Once you've paid good money for a beast of burden (which used to be a person), why not use it for all your beast of burden needs?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T06:53:10-08:00","id":785367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Guancyto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=785050#post785050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Although the rest of what Isator says is accurate, I will say, if I were a nigh-invincible demiurge, I would make sure that even my retainers and hangers-on were exceptionally strong-willed and strong-souled. My rivals might subvert them otherwise!</div> </div> </div> </div>What, so they get more difficult to leash back into their proper places in case they turn too willful or develop ideas and ambitions of their own?<br /> <br /> Easy done, easily replaceable, i say! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Guancyto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=785050#post785050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Being <i>just</i> a retainer to one of the seven rulers of the multiverse should be an incredibly competitive position, after all.)</div> </div> </div> </div>It can certainly sound promising depending on how one looks at it - but then, depending on how those beings reached such lofty places of rulership, the aforementioned 1/7 of the multiverse might not have much of a say or choice in the matter.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T21:38:16-08:00","id":785745,"title":"","content":"Wait, where was Mammon's race detailed? Is it a RPG thing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T02:12:31-08:00","id":785837,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.tumblr.com/post/132991223670/is-mammon-a-servant-what-is-up-with-those\" target=\"_blank\">Right here.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T09:27:07-08:00","id":786030,"title":"","content":"Thanks.<br /> <br /> My first thought was that the Servants are the equivalent of all the races Primordials made besides humans -- they can't exalt but they do have some magic and powers of their own.<br /> Except not extinct or dying out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-16T13:53:45-08:00","id":787613,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-3-40-creation/\" target=\"_blank\">Update.</a><br /> <br /> Abaddon's artwork and setting is awesome as always.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-16T14:43:40-08:00","id":787639,"title":"","content":"I'm glad to see an explanation for why the Void wasn't exactly very void.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-16T15:03:58-08:00","id":787654,"title":"","content":"I'm quite fond of these large panels with cosmology exposition and discussion. They're visually very evocative, and often clear up information about the world nicely or just offer new one.<br /> <br /> Speaking of, <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.tumblr.com/post/135297703965/so-weve-heard-of-vapor-liquid-and-igneous\" target=\"_blank\">apparently</a> Angels go from Plasma, through Vapor, Liquid, Solid and Crystal, to Neutron; Youngest to oldest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-16T17:44:37-08:00","id":787733,"title":"","content":"I think I preferred his style back when it was rougher and quicker. It was more... dynamic then, or something to that effect. Right now, the fires of the Wheel look too solid in my eyes.<br /> <br /> Which is unfortunate, because it's a cool page otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T00:36:54-08:00","id":795455,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-3-42-to-3-44/\" target=\"_blank\">New Offering</a><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wasn't expecting Incubus to show up this early. I guess this rules out Zaid and Incubus being the same guy.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T03:09:53-08:00","id":796574,"title":"","content":"Well... he's a lot more laid back then I would have expected. Even colloquial. Given the lore text, I'll be interested to see how much of that is a facade.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T05:57:15-08:00","id":796794,"title":"","content":"I've been letting the pages amass for a while and so was treated to the wonderful scene of the drinking contest in a single sitting. Those were some mad bars. How bad is it that I really, <i>really</i> tried to make Allison's lines at the end match up with the Sailor Moon theme?<br /> <br /> Still not entirely sure I understand how naming a devil works. Allison seemed to just be able to spew names as she liked. Then again, she does have a Magus Gate, and that might work as an Exaltation in the sense of &quot;yah, I can just do that shit&quot;. Her putting the devil mask back on seemed to be a very non-standard thing too, after all.<br /> <br /> This new page is really tight, too. I think some of the things mentioned in the thought squares are very important to Allison's character and to her progression throughout the story. Also, it shows that Incubus is about to attack a point where Allison might be the weakest: her self-image. That can be a very problematic fight for her to face.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T05:58:35-08:00","id":796796,"title":"","content":"He seems... a fair bit more self-aware than the other demiurges, in so far as their cosmological importance and their madness go. But is he really?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T07:06:02-08:00","id":796823,"title":"","content":"He is seducing her. Telling her what she wants to hear in addition to telling her what she needs to hear. Much easier to user her as a puppet if she thinks you are her friend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T07:10:06-08:00","id":796829,"title":"","content":"Incubus is one ugly motherfucker.<br /> <br /> And I say that knowing that the Wheel contains people with nostrils for eyes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T12:13:22-08:00","id":796942,"title":"","content":"Has anybody else considered his claim that he was aware of her before she even left Throne? And that he definitely knows that Zoss gave her a Key (even if he only seems to have it confirmed from what she's said to him), something even the others don't appear to know yet? I wonder what he was doing with that while she was still there. It may at least explain his absence from the Concordance. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>YeOfLittleFaith</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">He seems... a fair bit more self-aware than the other demiurges, in so far as their cosmological importance and their madness go. But is he really?</div> </div> </div> </div> I wonder if his power and nature might include a capacity to adjust himself or appear to somebody in terms that speak to them. The idea that he can draw idioms and qualities from her own experience and adopt them for himself. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Incubus is one ugly motherfucker.</div> </div> </div> </div> I think Jen might like him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T12:20:07-08:00","id":796946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=796829#post796829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Incubus is one ugly motherfucker.<br /> <br /> And I say that knowing that the Wheel contains people with nostrils for eyes.</div> </div> </div> </div>but...he's hot....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T12:29:53-08:00","id":796954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=796942#post796942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anybody else considered his claim that he was aware of her before she even left Throne?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was about 99% sure that he was the one Pramand Nand was talking to in that giant &quot;where-everyone-is-right-now&quot; map back in Hell 71.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T12:36:16-08:00","id":796957,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=796829#post796829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Incubus is one ugly motherfucker.<br /> <br /> And I say that knowing that the Wheel contains people with nostrils for eyes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you perhaps mean he has an ugly soul? Because he's looking <i>fine</i> to me.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T12:51:36-08:00","id":796974,"title":"","content":"That reminder does get me to the point where his claim is accurate, but still wondering about the follow up. Perhaps Nand himself <i>was</i> the response.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T16:06:41-08:00","id":797060,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://&quot;http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/kill-six-billion-demons-chapter-4/\" target=\"_blank\">Relevant Page</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T17:43:19-08:00","id":797093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=796942#post796942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if his power and nature might include a capacity to adjust himself or appear to somebody in terms that speak to them. The idea that he can draw idioms and qualities from her own experience and adopt them for himself.</div> </div> </div> </div>That feels like it might infringe on the Queen of Worms's traits, but I'll admit there's a fair difference between making oneself more appealing to a person by drawing on their experiences and wants, and stealing your temperament and appearance from their thoughts because of your own want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":188,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","user":"YeOfLittleFaith","date":". 12-30-2015, 08:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T18:15:01-08:00","id":797111,"title":"","content":"You want sexy? I present to you 23 Liminal Blossom Pierces the Heart of the Unrepentant, Deliciously (and I'm not talking about their form untouched by man).<br /> <br /> There's also Solomon David and his emperor beard, which I assume is sexy to <i>someone</i>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=796946#post79