stom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-11T23:14:01-08:00","id":845975,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=845972#post845972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Such amateurism by Mottom.</div> </div> </div> </div>Idk, I can't do that and I'd hesitate to call it &quot;amateur&quot; until I can surpass it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9258-col","name":"CoL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T00:27:38-08:00","id":845984,"title":"","content":"......<br /> <br /> Yeah. That's about what I expected.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T05:53:28-08:00","id":846037,"title":"","content":"Mottom looks so pleased with herself. <br /> <br /> So are the nobles going to be shocked or do the &quot;Our Queen is so Funny!&quot; golf clap?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T16:12:38-08:00","id":846318,"title":"","content":"Is that tree now rooted to the throne room?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T17:32:20-08:00","id":846345,"title":"","content":"It occurs to me that, since the Red-White Art is rooted in altering the target's perception of themself, that there may be some more direct significance to Mottom citing his concern over the hunger of others; that it's a hook in his personality that allows her to make the slight adjustments necessary to render him as a tree, compared to if she wanted to turn him into a beetle or something. I find this to have significant implications to my speculation that Jagganoth's current form is a result of somebody trying to assault him via the Art.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T04:36:30-07:00","id":847011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=846345#post846345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I find this to have significant implications to my speculation that Jagganoth's current form is a result of somebody trying to assault him via the Art.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe, I'm thinking someone chopped his head off, but he managed to live long enough to replace with an elephant's - in K6BD the soul seems to be independent and not tied solely to the brain.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T04:22:07-07:00","id":848075,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-4-67/\" target=\"_blank\">Behold <span style=\"color:#FF8C00\">Glory</span>, the First Syllable of Royalty.</a><br /> <br /> I assume.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T05:05:48-07:00","id":848087,"title":"","content":"And this is how a sorcerer keeps court. <br /> <br /> Turning people into things and then posing dramatically. <br /> <br /> It's surprisingly effective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T12:43:48-07:00","id":848349,"title":"","content":"You know, I'm pretty sure these guys made Mottom's day.<br /> <br /> I mean, just think about how these sorts of things must usually go. She sits around for days as people bring in a ton of things that probably all start to blur together after the first couple hours. Then this happens and she finally has something to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T17:15:23-07:00","id":848493,"title":"","content":"so, just an underling doing the recieving then. <br /> <br /> Gonna bet Alison frells her up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T20:37:47-07:00","id":848582,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=848493#post848493\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so, just an underling doing the recieving then.<br /> <br /> Gonna bet Alison frells her up.</div> </div> </div> </div>???<br /> <br /> &quot;Nadia Om&quot; is Mottom's real name, if that's what you're confused about. That's her there. She looks different than she did in the void because, remember, what we saw in the void was the projection of her soul (in the same way Allison initially looks bald and naked.) For whatever reason Mottom doesn't bother to keep up her appearances with her peers.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T23:31:51-07:00","id":848640,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=846345#post846345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It occurs to me that, since the Red-White Art is rooted in altering the target's perception of themself, that there may be some more direct significance to Mottom citing his concern over the hunger of others; that it's a hook in his personality that allows her to make the slight adjustments necessary to render him as a tree, compared to if she wanted to turn him into a beetle or something. I find this to have significant implications to my speculation that Jagganoth's current form is a result of somebody trying to assault him via the Art.</div> </div> </div> </div>Was that his actual form or his shade? Given Mottom's shade was old, withered, and ugly might his imposing size be more reflective of some aspect of his spirit or character such as being literally swollen with rage or having grown into a beast?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T02:36:53-07:00","id":848693,"title":"","content":"Apart from a single flash back image in the distant past, every appearance of and reference to Jagganoth has him appear or be described as enormous. I would find it weird for somebody to refer to him as an indestructible thirty foot tall engine of destruction that the Belligerant Knights can do nought but worship if that was only what he looked like in the Void. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">For whatever reason</div> </div> </div> </div> Probably because she hates them. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also maybe because they're the closest people to her in the multiverse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T02:48:55-07:00","id":848699,"title":"","content":"Considering numerous subordinates of the Seven were at the meeting and also appeared solid, I'm more inclined to consider Nadia's current appearance a glamour, and what's left of the concordance of demiurges a piece of the Wheel proper cut away and suspended in the Void by the Art (as the RPG indicates is possible, and Mottom's palace might also be with the addition of mobility).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":188,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","user":"YeOfLittleFaith","date":". 03-17-2016, 09:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T05:37:25-07:00","id":848730,"title":"","content":"I juat read the comic. Everyone else has so much more infomon what's going on.......","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T10:35:11-07:00","id":848865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=848730#post848730\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I juat read the comic. Everyone else has so much more infomon what's going on.......</div> </div> </div> </div>There's a lot of supplemental information in the author's <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Tumblr</a> devoted to questions about the comic.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T10:51:09-07:00","id":848873,"title":"","content":"I do wonder if Mottom isn't actually &quot;borrowing&quot; somebody else's younger, fitter, prettier body for herself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T11:12:39-07:00","id":848886,"title":"","content":"She might be using someone else's body, but I'm also somehow getting the feeling that it's not really a matter of disguise or trying to hide a &quot;true form&quot;. Mottom is untold centuries old. Her &quot;real&quot; appearance is &quot;supposed&quot; to be a withering corpse according to the mortal time scale. I don't think it'd be strange for someone of her power to create, possess or otherwise procure physical vessels the same way a mortal person would gradually change their wardrobe.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying that's not her &quot;real&quot; body. But I'm kind of guessing that the idea of a &quot;real body&quot; might not be a relevant concept in this case. She's not real or fake, she's just Mottom, such as she is now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T12:02:56-07:00","id":848911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Her &quot;real&quot; appearance is &quot;supposed&quot; to be a withering corpse according to the mortal time scale.</div> </div> </div> </div> Demiurges probably live a lot longer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T12:36:13-07:00","id":848920,"title":"","content":"So, apparently the RPG just got an update, including some fluff bits.<br /> <br /> Here's something regarding the Art<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What could be called magic in throne is known as the Art, and it is generally split into sub arts: Red, White, and Black. Using it is the 'art' of realizing that the entire universe is an illusion cast by the Flame Immortal, which permeates all things. It is often explained as the practice of lying to the universe convincingly enough that it becomes true. As such, it is explicitly vocal in nature, and heavily reliant on the practitioner\u2019s will for things to become true. To use the Art, the practitioner simply refines their will into an cutting edge and speaks aloud, lying about the nature of the universe. \u201cThis is not an apple,\u201d they might say, \u201cBut a plum.\u201d The apple then becomes a plum, of course, if that\u2019s what they prefer. The Art is described by many sorcerers as making their own small alterations to a story as it's being told. In theory it is very simple, but learning the ways to force your will on the universe and the right way to speak could take anywhere from a single month to a thousand years. The universe is sustained by the pure flame of the Gods themselves, and it takes a powerful and confident will to change that. This is evidenced by the fact that there are hundreds of schools of sorcery, but very few real sorcerers<br /> <br /> <b>Types of Arts</b><br /> <br /> <b>The Red Art</b> is associated with changing the existing physical universe or nonanimate matter. For example, someone could use the Red Art to transfigure bare stone into gold, to warp a wall into a door, or to bend the illusion of life into inanimate objects. Equally, a practitioner could use the same principles to harm by igniting the air into bolts of fire or animating swords to fight on their own (collectively called pyromancy). Predictably, it is the most common and versatile art by far. One important aspect of the Red Art is it needs materials - it must transfigure, bend, or warp something that is already there (for example, bending the dust in the air into an illusion of life). The closer the base material to the desired result, the easier the Art is. Iron into gold is far easier than water into gold, for example.<br /> <br /> <b>The White Art</b> is associated with changing the self or the self's perceptions. Common uses include dividing the universe to teleport short or long distances, divining hidden knowledge or casting your perception across dimensions, and aligning your soul flame (or atum) to physically transform your own body. Practitioners can shrug off bullets and blades like water, leap incredibly distances, or see through twenty-foot thick walls. The White Art is extremely hard to master and rarely sees use except by grand masters and very powerful or prodigious sorcerers. It is rumored that the ultimate use of the White Art is to turn back time, but this has never been observed.<br /> <br /> <b>The Red-White Art</b> is a mixed art, more common in many uses than the pure White, but extremely rare and difficult in its most powerful uses. It is utilized to use the Red Art to affect others (since their perception of self must also be altered), by changing their physical form or mental state. Common uses are in baleful transfiguration, or baleful warping (also known as cursing or red words). During the great war between demiurges it was used to turn men\u2019s skin to iron, reduce great kings to babbling idiots, or warp a warrior into a story-high monstrosity. At its peak practice, it can be used to kill with a single word. For this reason, its practice is taboo: restricted and even forbidden in many sorcerous circles and even many worlds.<br /> <br /> <b>The Black Art</b> is the rarest, simplest and most awe inspiring Art. It isn\u2019t known if any practitioners still live. The Black Art has only one fundamental use, and that is to create something from nothing. It is written in the few texts that speak of its study that this ability can be used to further kindle the Flame Immortal and create life. </div> </div> </div><br /> Incidentally Isator, seems like you're right about Jaggonath.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T13:10:32-07:00","id":848943,"title":"","content":"The stuff about the Art was in the first draft; the new stuff seems to be about the history of Throne, particularly the details of how the demiurges were originally a democracy and how Zoss disappeared from his kingdom rather than being apparently killed. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nervaqus987</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">seems like you're right about Jaggonath</div> </div> </div> </div> Yes, reading that stuff again reminded me of exactly what the basis for my supposition was. It was more overt than I had recalled.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T07:39:33-07:00","id":849252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=848865#post848865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a lot of supplemental information in the author's <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Tumblr</a> devoted to questions about the comic.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.tumblr.com/post/141209055915/in-my-travels-i-came-across-an-obscure\" target=\"_blank\">For example:</a><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u200b <img src=\"http://assets.tumblr.com/images/anonymous_avatar_24.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> Anonymous asked:<br /> In my travels, I came across an obscure, unconquered world. I was surprised to find a book which contained an account of the life of God-King Solomon David, who even in this backwater, which knew nothing of the Concordance or the Wheel, was regarded as a paragon of wisdom! To demonstrate this, it told the tale of two prostitutes who came before him with a babe, each claiming it as their own. The God-King rendered a judgement that amazed all who witnessed. How close is this tale to the truth?<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>A</b><br /> <br /> Very true. I believe the well-known story was that Solomon offered to split the babe in two for fairness\u2019 sake, and when the real mother began to cry, Solomon knew who was telling the truth.<br /> In fact, I was recounted the true story of this incident by a traveling peddler. Solomon was very kind to both women and listened to their concerns, leaving them with the promise of the assignment of a high imperial clerk to their case. The clerk quickly determined in no time at all through the well-organized imperial intelligence service that one of the prostitutes had a liason with a minor but decorated officer of the third legion some time ago. Questioning the officer uncovered very quickly the true identity of the baby\u2019s mother, who were notified and brought to one of the world courts at haste. It had scarcely been a day.<br /> Since lying in the court is a serious offense, the false mother was sentenced and executed later that day. Since copulating with an acting officer is a serious offense, the true mother was sentenced to six months of hard labor, her child was taken as a ward of the state, and her lover, the officer in question, was discharged from the imperial military, had his citizenship revoked, and died of complications from syphilis a year later, or so I hear.<br /> The true mother is doing better, I\u2019ve heard she is a clerk now, and her education was paid for by the crown.<br /> She will still never get her child back.<br /> </div> </div> </div>EDIT: Also I wonder if the blossoms and tree moves would both be Sorcery, or some form of sidereal martial art?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","user":"doran","date":". 03-18-2016, 05:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T23:36:48-07:00","id":849623,"title":"","content":"In-setting, they're clearly the red-white art, which would imply Sorcery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T02:37:53-07:00","id":849656,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-4-68/\" target=\"_blank\">Offering</a><br /> <br /> We've all been there Mottom.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T03:08:06-07:00","id":849662,"title":"","content":"Allison please please please don't try talking to the lady who just turned two people into shrubbery and a cool entrance, respectively.<br /> <br /> You're smarter than this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T10:33:22-07:00","id":849785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=848693#post848693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apart from a single flash back image in the distant past, every appearance of and reference to Jagganoth has him appear or be described as enormous. I would find it weird for somebody to refer to him as an indestructible thirty foot tall engine of destruction that the Belligerant Knights can do nought but worship if that was only what he looked like in the Void. Probably because she hates them. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also maybe because they're the closest people to her in the multiverse.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure of size, but<br /> 3-45 He appears to be human sized with a helmet on which resembles his current face but not quite so horrific. This scene is Cio recounting the demiurges forging the keys of kings.<br /> WoN 1-4 He also appears to be a human although with what might be injuries on his face. The event is the future demiurges sitting around the throne of Zoss. While most have similar outfits to the previous page I mentioned Jaganoth is dressed more plainly and Mottom appears to be in different cloths.<br /> <br /> Both predate the War, so it seems right that it was something that happened to him after he got his key. I do wonder if it was done to him with the Red-White art or if he did it to himself. Seems like something he could fix considering his power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T03:54:04-07:00","id":850087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=849662#post849662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Allison please please please don't try talking to the lady who just turned two people into shrubbery and a cool entrance, respectively.<br /> <br /> You're smarter than this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Remember the virtues of Aesma: ignorance, violence, and a foul temper.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T07:29:35-07:00","id":850122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> the future demiurges</div> </div> </div> </div> They would have still been demiurges, that being a term for everybody who followed Zoss into Throne or their descendents. The Seven are just the only <i>surviving</i> demiurges. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seems like something he could fix considering his power.</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ql4innmSFek\" data-code=\"ql4innmSFek\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ql4innmSFek/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T10:02:43-07:00","id":850167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=849662#post849662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Allison please please please don't try talking to the lady who just turned two people into shrubbery and a cool entrance, respectively.<br /> <br /> You're smarter than this.</div> </div> </div> </div>You say that, but you know damn well that she isn't.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T11:20:50-07:00","id":850203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=850122#post850122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> They would have still been demiurges, that being a term for everybody who followed Zoss into Throne or their descendents. The Seven are just the only <i>surviving</i> demiurges. <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ql4innmSFek\" data-code=\"ql4innmSFek\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ql4innmSFek/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>I lack the context to understand that reference. However, I meant if he cared. If the state was disagreeable to him I am certain he could have done something about it.<br /> <br /> Mottom can alter her appearance and I doubt she is the only one. Though if the color of text is any indication she seems to use the Red-White art a lot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T14:09:43-07:00","id":850251,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Revenge of TV Head</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=850167#post850167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You say that, but you know damn well that she isn't.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Come on, she's an anime nerd; Mottom's entire expression there just screamed Smug Anime Villianess. <br /> <br /> Allison would recognize that right? Please?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4578,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","user":"Zale","date":". 03-20-2016, 05:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T15:35:12-07:00","id":850279,"title":"","content":"Even if she does recognize it, she might just be too stunned by what went down to prostrate herself.<br /> <br /> I mean, a dude just turned into a tree, and then another dude was exploded into flower petals, and then <i>Blumenkranz</i> started playing at full blast. Allison can be forgiven if she's a bit distracted. Plus, she's got business to attend to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T23:14:31-07:00","id":850433,"title":"","content":"Okay, no new update as of yet, but I have found something pretty interesting.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.wikia.com/wiki/Royalty\" target=\"_blank\">Royalty.</a><br /> <br /> I always love these little glimpses into the metaphysics of KSBD.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-21T14:08:43-07:00","id":850800,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nervaqus987</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=850433#post850433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, no new update as of yet, but I have found something pretty interesting.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.wikia.com/wiki/Royalty\" target=\"_blank\">Royalty.</a><br /> <br /> I always love these little glimpses into the metaphysics of KSBD.</div> </div> </div> </div>For the background on it:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Lore:CHIM\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://images.uesp.net/3/3c/ON-npc-Vivec.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Lore:CHIM\" target=\"_blank\"> Lore:CHIM - UESP Wiki - The Unofficial Elder Scrolls Pages </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Lore:CHIM\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Lore:CHIM </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> CHIM (/t\u0283\u026am/ or /kim/) sometimes rendered in lowercase as chim, is an ancient Ehlnofex sigil connoting 'royalty', 'starlight', and 'high splendor'. It is also described specifically as the secret syllable of royalty. It is said those who truly know or understand CHIM reach a state of enlightenment, and can reshape the land. In the context of Ehlnofex incantations, CHIM can be used as a word of power. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Among other things the word Chim translates to Royalty, Starlight, or High Splendor and its everchanging glyph is described as a crowned tower.<br /> <br /> Also<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Molag Bal rose up and extended six arms to show his worth. They were decorated in runes of seduction and its reverse. They were decorated in the annotated calendars of longer worlds. When he spoke, mating monsters fell out. 'Where must it go?' he said. 'I told you,' Vivec said, 'I am meant to be the teacher of the king of the earth. AE ALTADOON GHARTOK PADHOME.' With these magic words, the King of Rape added another: 'CHIM,' which is the secret syllable of royalty.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T21:45:41-07:00","id":851583,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-4-69/\" target=\"_blank\">New Offering</a><br /> <br /> Mottom is the most fleshed out of the demiurges and it would be a shame to just have a fight and end it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T22:12:59-07:00","id":851588,"title":"","content":"Update.<br /> <br /> Let's be honest, we all saw this coming.<br /> <br /> Activating shit storm in 5....4....3....2....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-23T03:48:01-07:00","id":851647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=851583#post851583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mottom is the most fleshed out of the demiurges and it would be a shame to just have a fight and end it.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is likely to end with the Pursuers and 83 White Chain Born in Emptiness Returns to Subdue Evil crashing the party just as Allison's attempt to turn over the Key goes south.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-23T08:16:13-07:00","id":851760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=851583#post851583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-4-69/\" target=\"_blank\">New Offering</a><br /> <br /> Mottom is the most fleshed out of the demiurges and it would be a shame to just have a fight and end it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> She's probably only the most fleshed out because she's first - the others will probably get fleshed out before their books too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-23T08:20:59-07:00","id":851762,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>doran</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=851760#post851760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> She's probably only the most fleshed out because she's first - the others will probably get fleshed out before their books too.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah. I'm guessing Incubus will be next. Or the red guy who's name I can not remember.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T07:13:44-07:00","id":852405,"title":"","content":"I get the feeling that Incubus is being set up as the last one she faces judging from his placement in group shots of the demiurges. I have to say my curiosity is piqued by some of the weirder ones, Mammon, Gog-Magog and Jadis primarily I find interesting. I get the feeling their could be an opportunity to work with Solomon David as he seems the most (normal) but Pride is his vice and will probably be his downfall. But yeah lets see some more of the sleeping prophet Jadis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/669-hermes12","name":"Hermes12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar669_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T07:23:00-07:00","id":852412,"title":"","content":"I am convinced that Gog-Agog will be Allison's final foe, both because of the whole imitation thing and because of the original forum adventure. Also, I find Envy to be the nastiest of all seven sins.<br /> Failing her, it would likely be Incubus though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-27T18:01:14-07:00","id":854281,"title":"","content":"I just noticed a minor detail on one of the pages that might clarify something for me reagrding the depiction of the Concordance of the Demiurges; namely, on that picture showing the whole cosmology, the Void contains a series of grey shapes placed directly beneath Throne that looks a lot like where the Seven met. It then occurred to me that the corpses we saw there looked different from those seen around Throne; not red or stony, less decayed. It made me wonder if what we saw there were not the corpses of the gods' bodies, but of their souls, similar to the souls of the slain Prime Angels (except where they cannot reincarnate, as their immortal fire sustains the multiverse rather than being contained within themselves). I suppose that the spot marked at the pinnacle of the map of Throne may be where the Demiurges depart into the Void for their meeting, similar to how the Workshop of Koss has a direct correspondence with the Void which is where angels enter or depart from it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-03T22:21:58-07:00","id":858780,"title":"","content":"New page (for real this time.)<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">It appears the author was serious about this not necessarily being about resolving everything through violence, catchphrase notwithstanding.<br /> <br /> Of all the things people predicted Mottom might do, &quot;invite Allison to dinner&quot; was definitely not what most people expected. Yet when you think about it, it makes perfect sense and fits her themes... based on her court and achievements, she's a schemer and a socialite, not a warrior, so her first instinct would be to find out what Allison's deal is and try to turn it to her advantage rather than starting a brawl.<br /> <br /> And she likes to eat.<br /> <br /> Another observation: That appears to be Mottom's &quot;real&quot; hand (the one we saw in the void.) If we assume that the image we saw there is how she composes herself among equals and the image we saw more recently is how she speaks to subjects, we can infer that she considers Allison an equal, at least in some form.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":517,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","user":"Aquillion","date":". 04-04-2016, 01:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-04T08:33:46-07:00","id":859027,"title":"","content":"The flash back scene to the end of the war in White Chain's story shows her in armour, carrying a weapon, riddled with arrows and covered in blood. Even if we assume that's a bit stylized, she probably knows her way around a fight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-04T11:48:22-07:00","id":859146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=859027#post859027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The flash back scene to the end of the war in White Chain's story shows her in armour, carrying a weapon, riddled with arrows and covered in blood. Even if we assume that's a bit stylized, she probably knows her way around a fight.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's extremely unlikely that she would have survived the War if she wasn't a major league badass in a fight.<br /> <br /> That said, Mottom may simply be more comfortable as a socialite rather than as a warrior, no matter how adept she may be at the latter occupation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-06T10:31:53-07:00","id":860414,"title":"","content":"New offering:<br /> <br /> <div cla