kies<br /> In answer to their pleas<br /> Through boiling clouds of thunder<br /> Blasting bolts of steel<br /> Evil's going under deadly wheels </div> </div> </div>Every time I see 6 Juggernaut Star's bike I think of that song, but it's never been more appropriate than now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1551,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1551-barefoot-monkey","user":"Barefoot Monkey","date":". 05-06-2016, 06:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1551-barefoot-monkey","name":"Barefoot Monkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1551_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T12:22:06-07:00","id":885578,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-5-82\" target=\"_blank\">New Offering</a><br /> <br /> You would think a demiurge would have better guards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T13:55:28-07:00","id":885667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=885578#post885578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\