Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T14:46:39-07:00","id":885718,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=885668#post885668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bShe probably does. She probably keeps the better ones somewhere more important.</div> </div> </div> </div>No doubt they're in the ballroom, where all the interdimensional warriors and merchants and monsters are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T15:35:45-07:00","id":885737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=885668#post885668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bShe probably does. She probably keeps the better ones somewhere more important.<br /> <br /> Never mind how you'd have to have pretty damn good guards to not be instantly vaporised by one of the most powerful angels in existence.<br /> <br /> Never mind how being a guard is generally a tedious and unstimulating job that demands so little that effective responsiveness can be hard to maintain.</div> </div> </div> </div>Never mind how she has 1,111 universes, or at least planets, give or take the ones she hasn't conquered yet, to draw from.<br /> <br /> Never mind how a significant fraction of creation literally worships her.<br /> <br /> Let us hope the better ones are at least on the level of the ruffians in the brothel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T15:59:05-07:00","id":885752,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=885737#post885737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Never mind how she has 1,111 universes, or at least planets, give or take the ones she hasn't conquered yet, to draw from.<br /> <br /> Never mind how a significant fraction of creation literally worships her.</div> </div> </div> </div>What's your point?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bLet us hope the better ones are at least on the level of the ruffians in the brothel.</div> </div> </div> </div> Throne is reigned over by multiversal criminal syndicates and refugees from the domains of nigh-omnipotent tyrants. That brothel was the territory of a demigod possessed by a mighty demon who is the agent of a demiurge. Its criminal element is going to be a cut above the norm.<br /> <br /> Either way, think about it; why would you want the talents of somebody who can stand up in combat to an angel in perimeter or door guard duty, a position that consists of literally standing around 99.9% of the time.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T16:22:41-07:00","id":885769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=885752#post885752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's your point?</div> </div> </div> </div>She has an enormous pool of talent to draw from, many of whom will have pre-existing motivation to treat even the most menial duty as a serious holy duty.<br /> <br /> Throne is reigned over by multiversal criminal syndicates and refugees from the domains of nigh-omnipotent tyrants. That brothel was the territory of a demigod possessed by a mighty demon who is the agent of a demiurge. Its criminal element is going to be a cut above the norm.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=885752#post885752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Either way, think about it; why would you want the talents of somebody who can stand up in combat to an angel in perimeter or door guard duty, a position that consists of literally standing around 99.9% of the time.</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on how many of them there were and what needs I had for them. If she has a billion soldiers of that quality I imagine the casual decadence of using them for door guard duty might be a lovely way to show off exactly how powerful she is and how little she cares is obligated to care about the wastefulness of it.<br /> <br /> Also, my original comment was meant to imply that you want guards who live long enough to sound the alarm or delay the enemy until assistance shows up. If they are going to be vaporized by any meaningful opposition what is the point of having them there at all? She is already in a giant flying castle, the bar for people who are going to try to sneak in is already pretty high.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T17:01:40-07:00","id":885794,"title":"","content":"I'm guessing they are just meant as roadblocks for those of lesser power and speedbumps for those of greater.<br /> Basically to stop people bothering Mottom all the time and she has to PERISH them when she doesn't feel like it.<br /> <br /> Plus training really good guards kind of implies you really need them, and thus you might get more annoying assassins, having lousy guards as a Demiurge implies you can easily handle the assassins and raze their native world.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T18:37:50-07:00","id":885861,"title":"","content":"I'm not gonna say anything crazy, but wasn't 11 Juggernaut Star the one that killed Zoss?<br /> <br /> I don't think rank-and-file guards, even ones belonging to the Multiverse Empress, are going to stand up well in comparison.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T01:41:46-07:00","id":886031,"title":"","content":"6 Juggernaut.<br /> <br /> That's not just nitpicking! Of all the angels we've seen in the story, only two have incarnation numbers in the single digits, and the other one is a reincarnated Prime Angel.<br /> <br /> I imagine that most angels have racked up their reincarnations from the ancient war against the unbound devils and the Universal war, so to have gone through all of that with so few deaths (and keeping in mind that he's clearly of a zealous, martial sort, considering his actions, affiliations and name), he's probably a cut above the rest.<br /> <br /> I think that it can sometimes be hard to convey speed in a static visual medium, but under the circumstances (and with some visual indicators like attacking before his falling bike hits the ground or letting go of and then catching the object he's carrying in a sudden fluid motion), as well as how he seemed to move like a lightning bolt when he struck down White Chain, I take it that Juggernaut Star is unbelievably, horrifically fast.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T01:07:15-07:00","id":891618,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-5-83/\" target=\"_blank\">Update</a><br /> <br /> Being an NPC is suffering.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2034-jaytee","name":"JayTee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2034_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T02:04:21-07:00","id":891627,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=885578#post885578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-5-82\" target=\"_blank\">New Offering</a><br /> <br /> You would think a demiurge would have better guards.</div> </div> </div> </div>She can turn dudes into Trees. Seems to me she's all the security detail that she generally requires.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T16:49:45-07:00","id":892116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=886031#post886031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that it can sometimes be hard to convey speed in a static visual medium, but under the circumstances (and with some visual indicators like attacking before his falling bike hits the ground or letting go of and then catching the object he's carrying in a sudden fluid motion), as well as how he seemed to move like a lightning bolt when he struck down White Chain, I take it that Juggernaut Star is unbelievably, horrifically fast.</div> </div> </div> </div>I also can't help but note that the sound of thunder didn't show up until the first panel of this page.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-n