uch people (where they didn't come from the same background and hold the same values) to uphold such an image, lest they be given more painful deaths and retribution be visited upon their families.</div> </div> </div> </div>The issue with this is tha<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-3-51/\" target=\"_blank\">t they don't know they're going to be sacrificed</a> - the alt text mentions people think they probably have to be servants.<br /> A few hours since Alison last saw them is short for indocrination.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T01:35:24-07:00","id":915463,"title":"","content":"Notice how they're all tied up and, you know, dead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T02:49:32-07:00","id":915485,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I was gonna say. All the maidens at the bottom of the tree has had their throats slit and are probably already drained.<br /> <br /> To engage in some macabre speculation, I'd expect that they'd be somehow subdued (drugs or violence) in a way that doesn't waste their blood, then tied up and drained via cut along the throat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T19:50:49-07:00","id":916569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=915164#post915164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think many would not see much point in struggle.<br /> <br /> \u200bReportedly, human sacrifices in Aztec society could often be expected to go to the alter with quiet dignity and grace; apparently, the Aztecs viewed a sacrifice who would struggle or break down when faced with the knife to be a disgrace, and possibly something that would even taint the value of the sacrifice, so it seems that they conditioned such people (where they didn't come from the same background and hold the same values) to uphold such an image, lest they be given more painful deaths and retribution be visited upon their families.</div> </div> </div> </div>And/Or the victims understand that they can't really escape from the flying fortress of sorcerers and if they try there's the risk of their families getting punished in response.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_lin