 style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I wonder how many successes one needs in a feat of strength to lift the entire universe like Aesma XD</div></div> </div> </div>[/QUOTE]<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-23T11:30:25-07:00","id":919836,"title":"","content":"Way to one-up Tengen Toppa Gurren Lagann, Aesma <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1551-barefoot-monkey","name":"Barefoot Monkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1551_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-23T13:56:53-07:00","id":919931,"title":"","content":"^I never thought I'd actually hear those words used","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T23:20:39-07:00","id":920833,"title":"","content":"update <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://killsixbilliondemons.com/</a><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T00:21:37-07:00","id":920865,"title":"","content":"YOUR IDOLS ALL ARE MY RIVALS<br /> I RIVAL ALL OF YOUR IDOLS<br /> I STAND ON TOWERS LIKE EIFFEL<br /> I RIFLE DOWN ALL YOUR IDOLS<br /> <br /> (i wanted to just shout 'ROYALTY' but the forum software wouldn't let me so I just quoted some hiphop that reminded me of the recent page)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11538,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11538-kingcrackers","user":"kingcrackers","date":". 06-25-2016, 03:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11538-kingcrackers","name":"kingcrackers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11538_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"305"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T10:48:21-07:00","id":921028,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Morrowind:36_Lessons_of_Vivec,_Sermon_23\" target=\"_blank\">Vivec, is that you?</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T12:31:11-07:00","id":921087,"title":"","content":"The idea of Zoss popping up every now and then to be Allison's snarky mentor is something I would never have expected, and now think I always want (not in the sense of him being diminished by being around constantly, of course).<br /> <br /> I'm particularly delighted in him speaking so colloquially; it occurs to me that the one other time we heard him speak, it was just in disjointed sentence fragments.<br /> <br /> Perhaps the limits of being separated from Allison by a gulf of time and his own death are diminished the more she takes control of her own destiny.<br /> <br /> Also, given his status and how his first line is &quot;none of that&quot;, I wonder if I should start hearing his voice as that of the Dragonball Z Abridged version of Guru.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, so she named herself God? Pretentious prick. Metatron!&quot;<br /> &quot;{sigh} Yes king Zoss?&quot;<br /> &quot;From now on you may call me... Super Allison Zoss.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T17:45:17-07:00","id":921250,"title":"","content":"Something I think has been deliberately left ambiguous is exactly how and why Nadia began feeding that tree wives. I see two possibilities:<br /> <br /> She tried ignoring it until the torment of its constant plaintive cries became too much for her and she finally tried to feed it just to get some relief, and the resulting fruit is a significant part of what allowed her to take her place as a victor of the Universal War, creating a vicious cycle.<br /> <br /> She neglected it until it sprouted the fruit as a way of compelling her, and in the face of the Universal War, the fruit represented an advantage that she felt she couldn't turn down, and so she continued to feed it just to maintain that supply.<br /> <br /> I think either way might suggest why she could never really adopt the methods the other Six use to cheat death (well, Four or Five technically; Mammon is definitely a Servant, which means that he is immortal by default); it's not in her nature or her will to utilize such methods. Nadia is a person who lets herself be shaped by the world, and so lacks the Want to seize and wield such a name for herself as might make her more enduring.<br /> <br /> It's an interesting contrast between her and Allison.<br /> <br /> Nadia started herself along the path to Royalty when she asserted her own will against her husband by killing him (also committing regicide, which is the only true path to sovereignty), and this put her on a course to great power, but she ultimately failed to continue asserting herself in the face of obstacles such as the sprouting corpse of her husband or the guilds and kings she acquired dominion over. These things created satisfaction in her already attained victory, and so she stagnated. That is why Mottom wields the false name of Glory rather than the true name of I; she let her acquisition of power be something that shaped her into a figure of glamour and ceremony. That is also why, when faced with the opportunity, she tries to foist that position off on somebody else, which is not even as good as abdicating to try and discover herself. She is no Wielder of Names; she refuses to name the world as other than what she first sees of it, and refuses to name herself as something other than what Hastet Om and her subjects see of her (and what they made her see of herself). She has no self-love.<br /> <br /> Allison has had power thrust upon her by a dying king (possibly accidentally), and was thrust into a terrifying world of forces trying to command or exploit or destroy her beyond her understanding or power, and yet even from the very beginning, even while scared out of her mind and completely powerless, she kept asserting herself in small ways, demanding answers, demanding respect, demanding that the lofty powers debating her fate actually ask what she wanted. Think about it; while she was held captive by Delicious with Preem Vash and the opposing guild leaders parleying over her fate, she plaintively asked if anybody was going to ask her opinion on any of the proceedings. She knows many qualities of herself that she doesn't like, and thinks herself vastly underqualified for this journey, but she undertook it anyway, and she's had several points in which she's actively trying to be better than who she is, to not be constrained by the narratives of others, not only of herself but of <i>themselves</i>; she wouldn't let herself be completely beholden to Nadia's self pity. She even draws certain strengths from things that she hates about herself; she acknowledges that changing herself into a sorority sister didn't actually help with her esteem, but it also gave her a lot of drinking experience (although I'd warrant that she beat Vladok more because of the perspective of drawing strength from a hateful attempt to change, rather than the literal resistance to alcohol). Allison thought herself powerless, but she didn't revel in that, and it's what is leading her to this point of resolving to try and be powerful instead. She is on the path to self-love; she rejected the false name of Glory.<br /> <br /> I'd say that's a quality at the heart of why she was capable of masking that unbound demon (even if the Key was part of the actual power, the Will and Want is what is necessary to wield the Key).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T18:43:49-07:00","id":921278,"title":"","content":"That's a really good summation of her character as well as what Royalty might mean. However, I will contest a wee bit:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=921250#post921250\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She even draws certain strengths from things that she hates about herself; she acknowledges that changing herself into a sorority sister didn't actually help with her esteem, but it also gave her a lot of drinking experience (although I'd warrant that she beat Vladok more because of the perspective of drawing strength from a hateful attempt to change, rather than the literal resistance to alcohol).</div> </div> </div> </div>Allison invoked the name of her sorority, and her identity of as a sorority sister, to bullshit with demons, monsters, and sorcerers. My opinion of it is, lay on the bullshit thick enough, and it'll become the truth.<br /> <br /> Also: I just realized that Juggernaut Star's motorcycle might actually be made of wheel angels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11538-kingcrackers","name":"kingcrackers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11538_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"305"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T19:17:24-07:00","id":921290,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=921250#post921250\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[snip]</div> </div> </div> </div>Sermon 11<br /> <br /> &quot;There is once more the case of the symbolic and barren. The true prince that is cursed and demonized will be adored at last with full hearts. According to the Codes of Mephala there can be no official art, only fixation points of complexity that will erase from the awe of the people given enough time. This is a secret that hides another. An impersonal survival is not the way of the ruling king. Embrace the art of the people and marry it and by that I mean secretly have it murdered.<br /> <br /> &quot;The ruling king that sees in another his equivalent rules nothing.<br /> <br /> Sermon 13<br /> <br /> 'The ruling king is to stand against me and then before me. He is to learn from my punishment. I will mark him to know. He is to come as male or female. I am the form he must acquire.<br /> <br /> 'Because a ruling king that sees in another his equivalent rules nothing.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T21:08:30-07:00","id":921334,"title":"","content":"That's an excellent analysis touching not just on what we've seen on the comic but several of Abbadon's answers regarding the characters.<br /> <br /> At last Allison takes steps heard to all in her journey to name herself King.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":188,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","user":"YeOfLittleFaith","date":". 06-26-2016, 12:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-27T11:29:48-07:00","id":922111,"title":"","content":"Looking again at the fairly thorough exploration of Mottom's character in this arc, I wonder if one could appropriate pieces of her narrative and different facets as an immortal and flawed individual to build a more interesting and complex personage for the Lover Clad in the Rainment of Tears than previous editions; Perhaps reminiscent of Lady Om for being shaped by her practices and enslaved to the structures she allowed to be built around her as an icon of the preserved beauty of death in twisted embrace with the decaying sensations of life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":188,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","user":"YeOfLittleFaith","date":". 06-27-2016, 04:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-27T13:11:27-07:00","id":922185,"title":"","content":"I don't know if the comparison has already been made, but Aesma is a dead ringer for Isiodoros.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12009-truncatedchronologis","name":"truncatedchronologis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12009_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-27T14:43:38-07:00","id":922226,"title":"","content":"Someone once asked the author why White Chain pre-beatdown prayer apologizes to <i>Aesma </i>of all people for violence and Abaddon said that she chilled out a bit after seeing the true shape of the Universe and the secret name of God. I wonder if that time with the 3 masters was it, and we are starting to see the process of her chilling out in deciding to grow up, or if she has still to see the shape of the Universe again, paying a bit more attention this time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-27T15:49:47-07:00","id":922253,"title":"","content":"I wonder if general religious conceptualisations of the gods may be distinct from the myths featuring them as characters.<br /> <br /> \u200bAfter all, the story in which Aesma had her adventures with the three masters probably couldn't have literally happened as it is told, since it features YISUN as a person.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-27T21:21:40-07:00","id":922445,"title":"","content":"Based on what I have gleaned from the logic of KSBD, my guess of the answer is that &quot;YISUN is both a person, and isn't a person. Aesma's adventures both literally happened as told, and they didn't.&quot;<br /> <br /> Like I'm not trying to be clever here, Abaddon has answered questions like that before, and I feel like paradox is a major feature of the multiverse.<br /> <br /> I feel like either more &quot;happened&quot; to Aesma, that who the gods were don't matter very much, or that as per the principle of paradox, praying for forgiveness is ironically deciding that you don't need forgiveness at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11538,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11538-kingcrackers","user":"kingcrackers","date":". 06-28-2016, 12:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11538-kingcrackers","name":"kingcrackers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11538_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"305"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T19:22:57-07:00","id":922991,"title":"","content":"&quot;In The Throne, the flow of time is convoluted, with heroes centuries old phasing in and out.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2034-jaytee","name":"JayTee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2034_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T21:42:34-07:00","id":923060,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/wielder-of-names-5-96/\" target=\"_blank\">New Offering</a><br /> <br /> Apparently demons don't have to be literal demons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T21:45:43-07:00","id":923062,"title":"","content":"Royalty wields the Blade of Want to cut the universe into her desired shape.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T21:50:37-07:00","id":923066,"title":"","content":"I like how her killcount went up by 1 in the alt-text.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2034-jaytee","name":"JayTee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2034_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T22:09:23-07:00","id":923074,"title":"","content":"Someone just used their first charm! Enemy Castigating Solar Judgement by the looks of it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12009-truncatedchronologis","name":"truncatedchronologis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12009_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T22:17:12-07:00","id":923078,"title":"","content":"You call it a charm, I call it a Vajra.<br /> <br /> More or less the same thing, really.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11538-kingcrackers","name":"kingcrackers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11538_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"305"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-29T01:42:29-07:00","id":923135,"title":"","content":"There's a kind of poetry to the fact that the comments section of this comic can have &quot;The first leaf falls, marking the beginning of a tempest to stretch a season. Just as a rainstorm begins with one raindrop, so to does a murder begin with one drop of blood. Slaughter is inevitable. Kill six billion demons.&quot; followed immediately by &quot;eat shit murder tree&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11796-sergregness","name":"serGregness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11796_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-29T03:22:24-07:00","id":923153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JayTee</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=923066#post923066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like how her killcount went up by 1 in the alt-text.</div> </div> </div> </div>I cant read that on this device. Does she have more than one?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-29T03:22:38-07:00","id":923154,"title":"","content":"Heh, considering how the setting's religion places a certain value in ignorance, I just had the notion that Royalty using the blade of Want to cut infinity means that this cosmology's version of omniscience equates not to improbably being able to conceive of everything at once, but of being able to reduce everything down to the scope at which an individual mind can comprehend. In a metaphorical, deeply abstract way rather than literally destroying everything beyond one's perceptions; a sense of converting infinity into a comprehensible format in any given instance. Perhaps that is part of why it transcends causality; Zoss was still on the scope of a human being, but able to be anywhere he wanted and meaningfully perceive where he was simultaneously, so in any given interaction he can engage with something as though he has absolute knowledge, which is basically indistinguishable from him having such.<br /> <br /> \u200bA Wielder of Names shapes the world such that names are the truth of a thing rather than a comprehensible intermediary, at the same time as they shape themselves into a form that can encompass everything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-29T06:36:11-07:00","id":923216,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=923153#post923153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I cant read that on this device. Does she have more than one?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, her killcount is now 1/6,000,000,000","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/613-vegetalss4","name":"Vegetalss4","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar613_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-29T06:42:45-07:00","id":923218,"title":"","content":"Our heroine just killed Mottom by burning a tree. <br /> <br /> Cio: &quot;You just set a tree on fire? No big boss battle?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-29T11:08:18-07:00","id":923372,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=923218#post923218\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <di