title":"","content":"Hmm, so Abbadon is another person who finds character creation in Exalted to be impenetrable.<br /> <br /> \u200bI really don't understand how it isn't the simplest thing in the world. I hear these stories of people taking hours to build a character, and it's just perplexing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-13T12:36:31-08:00","id":1002608,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=1002600#post1002600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm, so Abbadon is another person who finds character creation in Exalted to be impenetrable.<br /> <br /> \u200bI really don't understand how it isn't the simplest thing in the world. I hear these stories of people taking hours to build a character, and it's just perplexing.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If you don't have charm trees, the process is almost impossible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T16:40:42-08:00","id":1003133,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=1002600#post1002600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm, so Abbadon is another person who finds character creation in Exalted to be impenetrable.<br /> <br /> \u200bI really don't understand how it isn't the simplest thing in the world. I hear these stories of people taking hours to build a character, and it's just perplexing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Analysis paralysis","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T21:22:17-08:00","id":1003237,"title":"","content":"I have to reread almost every list of charms for the skills I intend to give a character since I dont have them all memorized like everyone here seems to","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T23:20:13-08:00","id":1003262,"title":"","content":"If you have a worthy memory for numbers and dependencies, it's an excellent system in which to express informed choice to represent a hero of myth.<br /> <br /> If you just wanna have a good time and pick a bunch of neat-sounding tricks, you will probably not find yourself disappointed.<br /> <br /> If you have the urge to perfect a character with anything less than an afternoon to kill and a natural capacity for retaining otherwise entirely useless knowledge, it's torture.<br /> <br /> The last group is very large. I love Exalted, but that's the essential flaw of the charm-based superpower system.<br /> <br /> Anyway, more about fanfic! I freaking love the shoujo illustrations Cio did, almost as much as I do the expressions in the first three panels. I want to be her when I grow up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2223-ketrus","name":"Ketrus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"398"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T10:12:20-08:00","id":1003460,"title":"","content":"Exalted character creation is complicated, much like D&amp;D 3.whatever is, only worse, because <u>everybody</u> is a Wizard in D&amp;D terms. <br /> <br /> The sheer number of Charms and related caveats, dependencies, exceptions and &quot;aha!''s , is pretty much why my group and I play mortals. In fact, I find &quot;Charm bloat&quot; to actually be an <u>obstruction</u> in finding possible players, as they take one look at the 500+ page corebook and NOPE right the fuck out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11892-boston123","name":"Boston123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T11:08:06-08:00","id":1003490,"title":"","content":"Maybe that's because I love spending time crafting (hah!) characters (see 3rd category, but with time), or because so far I've only managed games with RP newbies for whom it's much faster and easier to state their concept and wanted tricks and make them accept or refuse my suggestions to round things up (see 2nd category), but I've never noped out of the corebook.<br /> There is a shitload of charms, sure, but if you focus exclusively on E1 Charms and only look at Supernals in a very thematic way (like &quot;oooh, she wants an explorer with a mount fighting alongside her, I'll check with her whether she prefers fighting together with the familiar and travel real good or unleash its hidden powers&quot;). Besides, as I said, building characters is my nerdy addiction.<br /> ... there <i>is</i> a shitload of Charms, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T11:30:48-08:00","id":1003502,"title":"","content":"The basic traits and the whole &quot;distribute this many dots&quot; system is incredibly easy to get, or at least that has been my experience introducing people to it since back when I first started with Vampire, but Charms can feel pretty impenetrable to new players or players used to rules-light games.<br /> <br /> Also, I'm very curious to read what &quot;the rest&quot; is that our resident angel wants Cio to tell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T01:00:10-08:00","id":1003809,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/seeker-of-thrones-2-8/\" target=\"_blank\">New Offering</a><br /> <br /> Her own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T01:07:47-08:00","id":1003813,"title":"","content":"So it's clear now what White Chain was surprised by Cio having not told Allison, and why she reacted as she did; Mammon's fortress is where she stole her key from, and she's probably not eager to return there.<br /> <br /> \u200bI like the touch of how the imaginary picture of an ebon devil when Allison was told about one stealing a key by one of those magisters was quite unlike what we're now being shown of Cio's prior form.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-19T06:12:34-08:00","id":1005323,"title":"","content":"Backstory.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/seeker-of-thrones-2-9/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://killsixbilliondemons.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/SOT9.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/seeker-of-thrones-2-9/\" target=\"_blank\"> Seeker of Thrones 2-9 &ndash; Kill Six Billion Demons </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/seeker-of-thrones-2-9/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/seeker-of-thrones-2-9/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","name":"NullApostle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-19T06:41:49-08:00","id":1005332,"title":"","content":"I like the variety in the designs for the Heretics' Court.<br /> <br /> \u200bI had been wondering if Yabalchoath's heist had been authorised by them, and had not considered the idea of approving something they wished to fail.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-19T07:41:22-08:00","id":1005344,"title":"","content":"The backstory we've all been waiting for, and it comes with juicy details. The diversity of the Heretics' Court is fetching; it makes sense Ebon Demons differ most uniquely from one another among devils, and it's good to see that show.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-19T08:36:49-08:00","id":1005365,"title":"","content":"We've also got the idea that Mammon has killed his family (if that's the meaning of the term &quot;kin&quot; being used here), which would probably be another extreme taboo in his society considering their close-knit clan structure.<br /> <br /> \u200bIt would seem that Zaid has been left with him due to how he almost never leaves his fortress. Indeed, the idea that he bought his initial key makes me wonder if Mammon isn't especially concerned with holding power at all; that he might see the stature of a demiurge just as a means to the end of accumulating wealth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-23T04:59:26-08:00","id":1007170,"title":"","content":"Thievery.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/seeker-of-thr