8:00","id":1008772,"title":"","content":"Everything in DotFA was incredibly dull compared to what we had devised beforehand.<br /> <br /> One of the greatest failures of 2e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-30T04:37:49-08:00","id":1010149,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=1008731#post1008731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Desus is tremendously exaggerated in fan discussions.<br /> <br /> Honestly, compared to the picture so many people painted beforehand, his actual description in Lords of Creation was positively dull.<br /> <br /> (Although to be fair, it would probably be dull even without that level of preamble)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd be inclined to say yes and no. While &quot;glory-hound wife-beater&quot; was certainly more...mundane than we'd been expecting, it's also a sort of real-world evil that gets a more visceral reaction from the audience than some of the people who were more of a real threat to Creation as a whole.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, prior to DotFA, Desus had been our primary example of a former incarnation connected to the present day, and the shady actions he took could be viewed as either the sort of audacious assholery that the Solars were good at in the name of achieving their goals (see Oliphem) or an example of how bad they got under the Great Curse (Lilith. Just...Lilith).<br /> <br /> Then DotFA rolls around and we learn that Desus was *always* a horrible person, and his abuse of Lilith completely dominates her character writeup. <br /> <br /> Tragedy: gone.<br /> <br /> ...Oh, wait, I completely forgot what I came here for.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/seeker-of-thrones-2-12/\" target=\"_blank\">Booyah. Allison starts to show off her own halo.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-01T10:18:17-08:00","id":1010692,"title":"","content":"If we were still in 2E, I'd say Allison was beginning to nicely channel the Holy Tyrant's Charms in that latest comic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2497-brian888","name":"Brian888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T09:13:24-08:00","id":1011525,"title":"","content":"Reality sinks in.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/seeker-of-thrones-2-14/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://killsixb