b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lots of nice little details in the current page, like the portrait of what is presumably the noodle vendor's wife, and something that is either a Gog Agog action figure or a novelty bottle opener.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd kind of interpreted it as a charm rather than an action figure, akin to a maneki-neko. Granted, a swimsuit demiurge might be a strange interpretation, but Gog-agog is kind of strange herself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-17T16:41:18-07:00","id":1064080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Barefoot Monkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=1063799#post1063799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">the portrait of what is presumably the noodle vendor's wife</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bWell, the noodle vendor's something; goblins have three different genders, and it's apparently extremely rude to ever ask which one an individual is.<br /> <br /> \u200bPersonally, it looks more to me like a kind of celebrity portrait.<br /> <br /> \u200bAbbadon finally came out with the last lore card for devils, and there are some interesting tidbits on the ebons, including the names of the members of the Heretic's Council.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T02:49:32-07:00","id":1069944,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/seeker-of-thrones-5-39/\" target=\"_blank\">New Update</a><br /> <br /> I wonder if Oscar's crew are the ones people designed for the heist, or separate?<br /> Probably the latter, since the deadline for the heist team was yesterday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T13:55:22-07:00","id":1070280,"title":"","content":"Man, every time I come back to this thread, I am struck again by how much I love that opening page for KSBD. I would really like to one day have a character do something that could be described as 'He smote their ruin across that dead city'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1982-space