:0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T15:10:40-08:00","id":1184101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maudova</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=1184099#post1184099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And your favorite? (add link)</div> </div> </div> </div>Goblins<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://goblinscomic.org/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://goblinscomic.org/images/logo-2025.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://goblinscomic.org/\" target=\"_blank\"> Goblins - Page 32 2026 </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://goblinscomic.org/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://goblinscomic.org/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Goblins is the story of a fantasy rpg through the eyes of the low-level monsters. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It has a lot of DnD references that aren't really for me, but when it hits right in the feels, it hits you hard!<br /> <br /> ...OK a little more context. It's about a band of goblins that are tired of getting picked on by adventurers and decide to become main characters themselves. So you have a goblin barb, a goblin cleric, etc....<br /> <br /> On the other hand you have another party of humans that slowly start to understand that not all monsters are XP farms.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23809,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23809-orukan","user":"Orukan","date":".  added the context part. 02-09-2018, 06:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23809-orukan","name":"Orukan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T19:25:37-08:00","id":1184197,"title":"","content":"[Griffin McElroy voice] i think infernals should be able to limit break","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T23:12:42-08:00","id":1184643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Orukan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=1184101#post1184101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Goblins</div> </div> </div> </div>Understand this isn't an insult to <i>Goblins</i>: you must really love to suffer if <i>Goblins</i> is your favorite comic.","s