ronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-19T09:49:32-08:00","id":1187583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dex Davican</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=1184851#post1184851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Man, I just said I <i>wasn't</i> bashing his fave! My point was that it's a comic largely about suffering.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm a big fan of web comics in general. OOTS is pretty good too (Been following it since the first battle VS Xykon), I just prefer goblins, not just because of all the suffering, but I really like the originality behind most choices.<br /> <br /> I admit that Goblins has its faults here and there. Some scenes can get either distracting or downright pointless (Not to mention the update schedule...) but I still like it enough to be feel as giddy as a teen on prom night every time there's an update.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23809-orukan","name":"Orukan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T23:31:44-07:00","id":1201548,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/seeker-of-thrones-10-123/\" target=\"_blank\">New Offering</a><br /> <br /> A battle of titans.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T00:22:30-07:00","id":1205482,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://killsixbilliondemons.com/comic/seeker-of-thrones-10-126/\" target=\"_blank\">New Offering</a><br /> <br /> Hey, guys, look, Sulumor's in K6BD!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3657-sagara","name":"Sagara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T04:11:14-07:00","id":1205526,"title":"","content":"Hehehe<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OopYaAAaniI\" data-code=\"OopYaAAaniI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/OopYaAAaniI/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Now, how do I feel about 001 fighting in elaborate bondage gear...<br /> <br /> Abbadon has earned a lot of good will by the fact that just about everybody else has been dressed in a manner that was, if not practical, then at least non-cheesecake. The only noteworthy exception to my mind is about one instance of showing Mottom with the rest of the Seven in a flashback, in a small and distantly emphasized manner. He himself has spoken critically of the more cheesecake artwork in his original forum game.<br /> <br /> So I think that's a reasonable basis to lend credibility to a sense that her looking like this while going into battle is something that displays character, rather than being solely intended to titillate.<br /> And given that it looks like she's dressed in a number of cilices, torturing herself as a show of empathy for God, it kind of acts contrary to the image of titillation (even if I'm sure there are people who would specifically find being scarred and dressed in painful gear to be sexual).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T04:20:45-07:00","id":1205528,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85157-kill-six-billion-demons?p=1205526#post1205526\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Abbadon has earned a lot of good will by the fact that just about everybody else has been dressed in a manner that was, if not practical, then at least non-cheesecake.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's kind of a given in this setting that some people just dress like that, and zealotry is high up the list of why they'd do so.<br /> 01's looks par for the course.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T04:56:51-07:00","id":1205535,"title":"","content":"Yeah sorry, I meant that as a joke, and not a commentary on the cheesecakiness. On my side, the character reminded me more of the fanatic in the Da Vinci Code, which seems par for the course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3657-sagara","name":"Sagara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T05: